{kaulajñānanirṇayaḥ}


[prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

	mūlāṅguṣṭhanakhāgrañca ete tattvasantati (ḥ) |
	aṣṭādaśavidhaṃ devi jñānañca kulagocare || 1/1 ||
	kathitaṃ sṛṣṭisaṃyogaṃ yathā tathā na bhairavi |
	kimanyaṃ pṛcchase nātha sugopyaṃ prakaṭīkṛtam || ||

[iti jñānanirṇitiyoginīkaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 1/1 ||





[dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ]



devyuvāca

	pañcāgnitapasaṃ taptaṃ varṣakoṭiranekadhā |
	tapastadadya me samyak tvatprasādena bhairava ||
	sṛṣṭiyogaṃ mayā jñātaṃ saṃhāraṃ kathayasva me || 2/1 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	sādhu tvāṃ kathayiṣyāmi saṃhārantu yathā bhavet |
	kālāgnirudrasaṃjñā tu nakhāgre nityasaṃsthitam || 2/2 ||
	yadā prajvalate ūrddhaṃ saṃhārantu tadā bhavet |
	vaḍavāmukhamahattvañca pātāle sahasaṃsthitaḥ || 2/3 ||
	saptapātālamuddiṣṭaṃ tasyorddhe svargasaṃsthitam |
	etāni kathitā bhadre bhuvanāni caturdaśa || 2/4 ||
	jñātavyā dehamadhye tu tattvarūpā sthitā priye |
	sarvajñā (yatna (?)) saṃlīnaṃ layañca śaktigocare || 2/5 ||
	śivamadhye gatā śaktiḥ kriyāmadhyasthitaḥ śivaḥ |
	jñānamadhye kriyā līnā kriyā līyati icchayā || 2/6 ||
	icchāśaktirlayaṃ yāti yatra tejaḥ paraḥ śivaḥ |
	saṃhārantu imaṃ bhedena kathitantava śobhane || 2/7 ||
	saṃhārantu padānyastaṃ kruddhaḥ saṃharate jagat |
	sṛṣṭiyogaṃ padānyastaṃ sṛjatyevaṃ carācaram || 2/8 ||
	adhasthā saṃsthitā bhuktiḥ ūrddhaṃ muktirvarānane |
	pūrvaṃ yat sūcitaṃ devi sṛṣṭiyogaṃ mayā tava || 2/9 ||
	sṛṣṭisaṃhāranyāyena kulādhāramupavarṇitam |
	kimanyaṃ pṛcchase nāthe sugopyaṃ prakaṭīkṛtam || 2/10 ||

[iti jñānanirṇitiyoginīkaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 2/2 ||



[tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca 

	kulalakṣaṃ maheśāna ātmasamvittipūrvakam |
	etanme saṃśayo nātha prasādībhava śaṅkaraḥ || 3/1 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	śṛṇumekāgracittā kulalakṣannigadyate |
	yatra dṛṣṭirmanastatra bhūtendriyamapudgalaḥ || 3/2 ||
	svaśaktijīvabhūtāni dṛṣṭirlakṣairlayaṃ gatā |
	sthānaṃ dhyānañca varṇañca lakṣañcaiva catuṣṭayam || 3/3 ||
	piṇḍasaṃjñā bhavet sthānaṃ dhyānantatpadamucyate |
	varṇarūpaṃ vinirdiṣṭaṃ lakṣaṃ vai rūpavarjitam || 3/4 ||
	piṇḍañcopapadarūpaṃ rūpātītaṃ varānane |
	sthāne sthāne sthitandevi ekaikasya caturvidham || 3/5 ||
	catuṣpatrañca aṣṭāraṃ dvādaśāraṃ varānane |
	pañcāraṃ ṣoḍaśārañca catuḥṣaṣṭidalampriye || 3/6 ||
	śatapatraṃ suśobhāḍhyaṃ sahasraṃ dalaśobhitam |
	koṭipatraṃ sutejāḍhyaṃ tasyorddhe anyathā śṛṇu || 3/7 ||
	arddhakoṭisamāyuktaṃ koṭitrayasamanvitam |
	karṇikākeśarairyuktaṃ dīpyamānaṃ (tathaiva ca) || 3/8 ||
	tasyorddhe vyāpakantatra nityoditamakhaṇḍitam |
	svātantramabjamacalaṃ sarvavyāpī nirañjanam || 3/9 ||
	tasyecchayā bhavet sṛṣṭirlayantatraiva gacchati |
	tena liṅgantu vikhyātaṃ yatra līnaṃ carācaram || 3/10 ||
	akhaṇḍamaṇḍalaṃ rūpaṃ nirvikāraṃ saniṣkalam |
	ajñātvā bandhamuddiṣṭaṃ jñātvā bandhaiḥ pramucyate || 3/11 ||
	unmanammanarahitaṃ dhyānadhāraṇavarjitam |
	pratyakṣaṃ sarvadā nityaṃ atasipuṣpasannibham || 3/12 ||
	sarvavarṇamayandevaṃ sarvavarṇairvivarjitam |
	jñānagamyaṃ sadā devi pāramparyakramāgatam || 3/13 ||
	kathitaṃ devi saṅkāśaṃ kulalakṣaṃ (tathā) sthitam |
	na kāṣṭhaṃ mṛṇmayaṃ liṅgaṃ na śailaratnasambhavam || 3/14 ||
	na cittaṃ rītikādinī na hemaṃ lohasambhavam |
	sphaṭikaṃ maulikaṃ vāpi trapuṃ sīsakatāmrajam || 3/15 ||
	puṣparāgodbhavādīni ye cānye lokapūjitāḥ |
	aṣṭādaśa lokaśāstrāṇi krurāścādhyātmikāstathā || 3/16 ||
	taistu yat pūjitaṃ devi manasāpi na pūjayet |
	kiṃ kāraṇaṃ mahādevi paśavo jñānavarjitāḥ || 3/17 ||
	ajñānāste durācārāḥ kulājñakavivarjitāḥ |
	na taistu saṅgabhoktavyaṃ na kuryāddravyasaṃgraham || 3/18 ||
	brahmādyāstu surāḥ sarve asurāśca tapodhanāḥ |
	yakṣagāndharvasiddhāśca tṛṇagulmapipīlikāḥ || 3/19 ||
grahanakṣatratārādijagatsthāvarajaṅgamā(ḥ) |
	niṣkrāntā bindumadhye tu laulībhūtantu tatsamam || 3/20 ||
	sṛṣṭisaṃhārakartāraṃ talliṅgaṃ siddhapūjitam |
	sphurantan nirmalannityaṃ aprameyaṃ sadoditam || 3/21 ||
	jvalantaṃ ulkasadṛśaṃ vidyuttejo nabhastale |
	etalliṅgavaraṃ jñātvā dṛṣṭvā mokṣasya bhājanaḥ || 3/22 ||
	pāṣāṇavṛṣṭisaṃghātairmahāmeghaiḥ sudāruṇaiḥ |
	na naśyedagninā liṅgaṃ na pated vajratāḍitam || 3/23 ||
	etantu pūjayeddevi kaulikaṃ siddhimicchatā |
	arcayenmānasaiḥ puṣpaiḥ sugandhairdhūpadīpitaiḥ || 3/24 ||
	ahiṃsā prathamaṃ puṣpaṃ dvitīyendriyani(gra)ham |
	tṛtīyantu dayāpuṣpambhāvapuṣpañcaturthakam || 3/25 ||
	pañcamantu kṣamāpuṣpaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ krodhavinirjitam |
	saptamaṃ dhyānapuṣpantu jñānapuṣpantu aṣṭamam || 3/26 ||
	etat puṣpavidhiṃ jñātvā arcayelliṅgamānasam |
	bhuktimuktimavāpnoti dehaliṅgārcanena tu || 3/27 ||
	siddhiliṅgamidaṃ devi dehasthaṃ pratyayānvitam |
	manoliṅgaṃ sadā dhyāyed yāṃ yāṃ phalasamīkṛte || 3/28 ||
	tāṃ labhante na sandeho ātmasambittipūrvakam |
	etat te kaulikandevi dehaliṅgasya lakṣaṇam || 3/29 ||
	anyantu varjayeddevi pāṣāṇaṃ kāṣṭhamṛnmayam |
	laukikam mārgasampannā siddhimuktivivarjitā || 3/30 ||
	dehasthā vāsanā yasya tasyaivāṃśo kulāgame |
	bahisthā vāsanā yasya saḥ paśuraṅgarañjitaḥ || 3/31 ||
	etante kathitaṃ devi nāmnā jñānasya nirṇitiḥ |
	dātavyaṃ bhaktisaṃyukte na deyaṃ bhaktivarjite || 3/32 ||

[iti jñānanirṇitiyoginīkaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 3/3 ||



[caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ]


devyuvāca 

	adya me saphalañjanma tapastaptaṃ sureśvara |
	adya me nirmalandehaṃ tvatprasādena bhairava || 4/1 ||
	svagṛhe svadeśe vā pāśastobhaṃ yadā bhavet |
	nigrahānugrahañcaiva krāmaṇaṃ haraṇaṃ tathā || 4/2 ||
	pratimājalpanañcaiva ghaṭapāṣāṇasphoṭanam |
	kathaṃ me sarvasaṃkṣepāttvameva śaraṇaṅgatā || 4/3 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	sādhu sādhu mahādevi kathayāmi mahātape |
	kulapiṇḍaṃ samālikhya nāḍī nāḍīmukhaiḥ saha || 4/4 ||
	vidyāmantramayaṃ piṇḍaṃ bhuktimuktipradaṃ śubham |
	nāḍī nāḍīmukhairvāpi adhorddhaṃ rephadīpitam || 4/5 ||
	vāyuviṣṇu(ḥ) sabinduśca taptacāmīkaraprabham |
	janmamaṇḍalasaṃlīnaṃ dhvāntateja(ḥ)samaprabham || 4/6 ||
	sādhakaḥ sādhyadehe tu paśudehe tu hṛdgatam |
	karastobhādikaṃ bhadre karotyevaṃ carācaraiḥ || 4/7 ||
	bindunāda(sta) tathā śaktirdīptadhyānamathāpi vā |
	janmamanḍalasaṃlīnaṃ dhvāntateja(ḥ)samaprabham || 4/8 ||
	sādhyadehagatañcintya nimeṣārddhaṃ stubhyate paśuḥ |
	dhyātvā vidyullatākāraṃ śaktirvai vyomapañcake || 4/9 ||
	stubhyate ca jagatsarvaṃ ghaṭikārddhe varānane |
	śaktivijñānavedhena manākhyena mahānmane || 4/10 ||
	baddhvā caitat pāśena parvatānapi lālayet |
	paradehe parāśaktirnādenākramya vedhayet || 4/11 ||
	calane bālyane caiva badhvā mudrābandhane |
	atītānāgatañcaiva pṛṣṭāsau kathayiṣyati || 4/12 ||
	akārādihakārāntaṃ kulapiṇḍasya bhairavi |
	śaṃkhābhiṣekavijñānaṃ dantakāṣṭhādikampriye || 4/13 ||
	puṣpāñjalikarastobhamekaikaṃ varṇadīpitam |
	māraṇoccāṭanañcaiva stambhamohādikaṃ priye || 4/14 ||
	śāntikampauṣṭikaṃ vāpi ākṛṣṭiñca vaśantathā |
	pañcāśavarṇasaṃyogaṃ jñātvā sarvaṃ kuru priye || 4/15 ||

	hūṃ māraṇaṃ yūṃ yaḥ uccāṭanaṃ rūṃ ra jvarakaraṇaṃ buṃ va 
adhyāyanaṃ lūṃ la stambhanaṃ śūṃ śa śāntikaṃ ṣūṃ ṣa kīlanaṃ kṣeṃ 
kṣa (......) kṣuṃ kṣa paśugrahaṇaṃ klīṃ kṣṇīṃ vaśīkaraṇaṃ kleṃ kṣṇoṃ 
kṣobhaṇaṃ mohanañca soṃ sa sadyapratyayaḥ siddhiḥ ho haḥ viṣanāśanaṃ hro 
hraḥ raktākṛṣṭiyoginīnāñca jūṃ saḥ mṛtyuñjayaḥ (.....) pratimādiṣu jalpanaṃ 
sphoṭanañca | sroṃ śaḥ pāśastobhādikaṃ kāmarūpindhaṃ bhrū tra 
ḍākinīsiddhiḥ jhura rākṣasīsiddhiḥ | lūṃ la lākinī siddhiḥ(,) luṃ ka 
kusumālinīsiddhiḥ yūṃ ya yoginīsiddhiḥ hrīṃ ha ākarṣaṇaḥ ||

	ekaikena tu bījena varṇarāśirvibhedayet |
	kurute vibhidaṃ karma yaddevi manasepsitam || 4/16 ||
	dīkṣānteṣṭikakarmeṣu viparītaṃ mātṛkaṃ (care)t |
	yojayettāṃ kulādhā(raṃ)tu sarvaṃ jñātvā dṛḍhalakṣavit || 4/17 ||
	tejorūḍhamparaṃ liṅgaṃ taṃ līnaṃ sthāpayet paśuḥ |
	svātantro muktimāyāti sarvahṛdbhavane tu saḥ || 4/18 ||
	sarvajñaguṇasaṃpūrṇa ityevaṃ bhairavo'bravīt |
	yat tvayāpṛcchitambhadre sugopya siddhikāraṇam || 4/19 ||
	gopitavyamprayatnena duṣṭānāmbhaktivarjitam |
	na deyaṃ bhaktihīnasya kaulikīṃ siddhimicchatām || 4/20 ||

[iti jñānanirṇitiyoginīkaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 4/4 ||




[pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca 

	mṛtyuñjayammahādeva kathayasva prasādataḥ |
	ajñānatamasācchannā yathā bhrāntirvinaśyati ||
	kathayasva mahādeva bhrāntinirnāśanaṃ param || 5/1 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	yenaiva jñānamātreṇa dhyānābhyāsena nityaśaḥ |
	sarvadvandvavinirmukta sa gatābhyāsatatparaḥ || 5/2 ||
	sādhayet sakalārthānāṃ manasā yat samīhitam |
	uttiṣṭha khaḍgapātālaṃ rocanāñjanapādukam || 5/3 ||
	guṭikākāśagamanaṃ rasañcaiva rasāyanam |
	antarddhānambhaveddevi tathānyañca rasāyanam || 5/4 ||
	sādhayennātra saṃdeho dhyānayuktapadā bhavet |
	śṛṇu tvaṃ ekacittantu kathyamānaṃ mayā priye || 5/5 ||
	sitañca śītalandivyaṃ sugandhaṃ bhūritejasam |
	candrāhlādakaraṃ divyaṃ āgacchantaṃ khamadhyataḥ || 5/6 ||
	sravantaṃ bahurandhreṇa acirānmṛtyujidbhavet |
	na jarāmaraṇantasya vyādhirogo na vidyate || 5/7 ||
	līlayā siddhibhāgyo'sau bhavatyevaṃ varānane |
	kṣīrodārṇavamadhyasthaṃ śvetaṃ kamalavistaram || 5/8 ||
	sahasrakoṭipatraṃ vā tanmadhye ātmānaṃ budhaḥ |
	tasmiṃścaiva niviṣṭaṃ tu sitābharaṇabhūṣitam || 5/9 ||
	tādṛśenaiva padmena upariṣṭādyaṭitampriye |
	kṣīrodavi(śe)ṣaiḥ sarvaissiñcyamānamanusmaret || 5/10 ||
	mucyante sarvarogaistu jarāmaraṇabandhanaiḥ |
	krīḍate vividhairbhogairicchārūpañca jāyate || 5/11 ||
	athānyaṃ sampravakṣyāmi mṛtyuñjayaṃ viśeṣataḥ |
	dhyātvā candrāsanasthañca ūrddhaścandreṇa ghaṭṭitam || 5/12 ||
	sīkaraiḥ śītalairdivyaiḥ siñcyamānamanusmaret |
	jarāmaraṇanirmuktaṃ sarvavyādhivivarjitam || 5/13 ||
	saṃvatsaraprayogeṇa sāmānyaṃ yoginīkulaiḥ |
	anyañca adbhutandevi śṛṇu tvaṃ kulabhāvini || 5/14 ||
	saṃpūrṇopūrṇamāpūrṇaśaśāṅkaparimaṇḍalam |
	dhyāyamānamidandevi jarāvyādhirvinaśyati || 5/15 ||
	athānyaṃ śṛṇu kalyāṇi yathātathyena bhāvini |
	dhyāyeccandramidaṃ devi nābhimūrdhni ca hṛdgatam || 5/16 ||
	abhyaset samacittastu abdamekaṃ nirantaram |
	tataḥ svātantramāyāti jarāmaraṇavarjitam || 5/17 ||
	punaranyaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu tvaṃ vīravandite |
	sahasradalaśobhāḍhyaṃ gokṣīradhavalopamam || 5/18 ||
	devyā cakragatañcakraṃ tādṛśaṃ khecaraiḥ sthitam |
	adhaścakrasamārūḍhaṃ ūrddhacakreṇa plāvitam || 5/19 ||
	satatamabhyased yogī siñcyamānaśca vi(śe)ṣaiḥ |
	valīpalitanirmuktaḥ sarvavyādhivivarjitam || 5/20 ||
	krīḍate saḥ samudrāntaṃ svātantraḥ sidhyate priye |
	anyadapyadbhūtaṃ devi śṛṇutaikāgramānasam || 5/21 ||
	ṣoḍaśāramnahāpadmaṃ himakundendusamprabham |
	sthāne sthāne tu taṃ dhyātvā śivādyāvīcigocaram || 5/22 ||
	bindudhārānipātaiśca viplavaiḥ pūritantanuḥ |
	niṣkrāntaṃ romakūpa	iśca gokṣīrahimasannibham || 5/23 ||
	na jarāmaraṇantasya vyādhiroganna vidyate |
	svātantraḥ śivatulyastu svacchandagaticeṣṭitaḥ || 5/24 ||
	pūjyate suravṛndaistu divyakanyāranekadhā |
	guhyanābhihṛdi kaṇṭhe vaktre mūrdhni śikhāntare || 5/25 ||
	muṇḍasandhigatā devi pṛṣṭhamadhye tridaṇḍakam |
	ekādaśavidhā devi cakrāṇi ca sahasrikā || 5/26 ||
	pañcāraṃ aṣṭapatrañca daśa dvādaśa patrakam |
	ṣoḍaśaṃ śatapatrañca koṭipatraṃ yathaiva ca || 5/27 ||
	ebhiḥ sthāne samabhyastaṃ dadate vividhaṃ phalam |
	raktaṃ vaśyaṃ sadā devi mahābhogapradāyakam || 5/28 ||
	pītaṃ stambhakarannāthe dhūmramuccāṭanaṃ sadā |
	śuklamāpyāyane proktaṃ viśeṣaṃ śāntikārakam || 5/29 ||
	gokṣīradhārādhavalaṃ kathitaṃ mṛtyuñjaye hitam |
	taptacāmīkaraprabhaṃ purakṣobhādikāraṇam || 5/30 ||
	bindunādatathāśaktirevaṃ dhyātvā pṛthak pṛthak |
	dharmārthau kāmamokṣau ca aṇimādiguṇāṣṭakam || 5/31 ||
	atītānāgatandevi rūpasya parivartanam |
	bhavatyevaṃ na sandeho abhyāsāt tadgatasya tu || 5/32 ||
	gurubhaktiryoginīnāṃ kulakaulāgameṣu ca |
	amaratvaṃ bhaveddevi jayenmṛtyuṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 5/33 ||
	kathitaṃ mṛtyuñjayandevi sarvajñānasya nirṇayam |
	gopitavyaṃ prayatnena martyaloke narādhame || 5/34 ||
	durlabhaṃ siddhisandohaṃ gopitavyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
	dātavyaṃ pūrvasiddhasya abdamekaparīkṣitam || 5/35 ||

[iti jñānanirṇitiyoginīkaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 5/5 ||



[ṣaṣṭhaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca 

	adya me saphalaṃ janma mama dehe kuleśvara |
	tvatprasādena kauleśa jñāto'haṃ kaulanirṇayaḥ || 6/1 ||
	anyāni jñātumicchāmi vada me jīvalakṣaṇam |
	ko'sau jīvaḥ samuddiṣṭaḥ kiṃ vā jīvasvarūpakam || 6/2 ||
	kiṃ varṇaṃ kimpramāṇañca kasmin sthāne vyavasthitam |
	kasmiṃścaiva layaṃ yāti tatsarvaṃ kathayasva me || 6/3 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	śṛṇu tvaṃ vīracāmuṇḍe varaṃ jīvasya nirṇayam |
	sa(ḥ)paraṃ niṣkalaṃ nityaṃ nirāmayanirañjanam || 6/4 ||
	paramāṇumucyate nātho sa śivo vyāpakaḥ paraḥ |
	sa(ḥ) jīvaḥ parataro yastu sa(ḥ) haṃsaḥ śaktipudgala(ḥ) || 6/5 ||
	sa(ḥ) mano matparaṃ prāṇaḥ sa(ḥ) buddhiścittameva ca |
	samīrapūrako vāyuḥ sarvajīveṣu saṃsthitam(ḥ) || 6/6 ||
	dehasthastiṣṭhate yāvattāvajjīvo'pi gīyate |
	sa dehatyaktamātreṇa paraṃ śivo nigadyate || 6/7 ||
	nābhisthaṃ hṛdi kaṇṭhe ca vaktranāsāpuṭantathā |
	karṇasthaṃ śrūyate devi pāramparyakramāgatam || 6/8 ||
	kaulikantu idaṃ devi karṇāt karṇasamāgatam |
	anena jñānamātreṇa śrutena ca varānane || 6/9 ||
	mucyate sarvapāpebhyo bhavadbhiḥ samupārjitam |
	ṣaṇmāsādabhyasedyastu kāṣāyaṃ bandhavarjitam || 6/10 ||
	asyāpi śokasantāpajarāvyādhirvinaśyati |
	sarvavyādhivinirmukto yogibhiḥ sahamelakam || 6/11 ||
	aṇimādiguṇaiśvaryaṃ siddhiśca mānasī bhavet |
	etatte jīvamabhyāsaṃ kathitaṃ te ca bhairavi || 6/12 ||
	kulāgamasubhaktāya gurudevyā prapūjake |
	sarvabhāvopapannasya dātavyaṃ kṛtaniścaye || 6/13 ||
	māyāvine śaṭhe krūre prapañcairliṅgine tathā |
	na deyaṃ kaulikaṃ sāraṃ yoginīnāntu sambhavam || 6/14 ||

devyuvāca 

	saphalaṃ adya me nātha tapo mahyaṃ sureśvara |
	adya me nirmalaṃ dehamajñānapaṭalāhatam || 6/15 ||
	prakāśitaṃ mahājñānaṃ yatsurairapi durlabham |
	sāmprataṃ śrotumicchāmi kālasya vañcanaṃ śubham || 6/16 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	atyantagahanaṃ nāthe pṛcchito'haṃ tvayādhunā |
	kathayāmi na sandeho yathā mṛtyurvinaśyati || 6/17 ||
	prasārya danturāyāntu yāvad brahmavilaṅgataḥ |
	amṛtāgraṃ rasāgreṇa dahyamānasudhīrapi || 6/18 ||
	māsena jitayenmṛtyuṃ satyaṃ satyaṃ mahātape |
	rasanātālumūle tu kṛtvā vāyuṃ pibecchanaiḥ || 6/19 ||
	ṣaṇmāsādabhyaseddevi mahārogaiḥ pramucyate |
	abdamekaṃ yadābhyastañjarāmṛtyurvinaśyati || 6/20 ||
	atītānāgatañcaiva dūrādiśravaṇantathā |
	viṣaṃ na kramate dehe daṃśito'pi mahoragaiḥ || 6/21 ||
	sthāvaraṃ jaṅgamaṃ vāpi kṛtrimaṃ garalaṃ tathā |
	chedyamāno na chidyeta tadgato tanmano yathā || 6/22 ||
	dvau rājada(?)madhyasthaṃ bindurūpaṃ vyavasthitam |
	amṛtaṃ taṃ vijānīyādbalīpalitanāśanam || 6/23 ||
	śītalaṃ sparśasaṃsthāne rasanāṃ kṛtvā tu buddhimān |
	balīpalitanirmuktaḥ sarvavyādhivivarjitaḥ || 6/24 ||
	na tasya bhavate mṛtyuryogayānaparaḥ sadā |
	rasanā tālumūle tu vyādhināśāya yojayet || 6/25 ||
	tiṣṭhañjāgran svapaṅgacchan bhuñjan maithune rataḥ |
	rasanaṃ kuñcayennityaṃ svavaktreṇa tu saṃyutam || 6/26 ||
	na mṛtyurbhavate tasya abdāt svacchandago bhavet |
	hṛdisthañca manaḥ kṛtvā yāvadunmanatāṃ gataḥ || 6/27 ||
	āgataṃ nāśayenmṛtyuṃ ghaṭikārddhe varānane |
	kālasya vañcanaṃ devi sugopyaṃ prakaṭīkṛtam || 6/28 ||


[iti jñānanirṇitiyoginīkaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate ṣaṣṭhaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 6/6 ||



[saptamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca 

	palitastambhavijñānaṃ jarāmaraṇanāśanam |
	tritattvaṃ katha me nātha tvameva śaraṇaṃ gatā || 7/1 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	palitastambhavijñānaṃ śṛṇu tvaṃ vīramātare |
	devyāścakragataṃ cintya(?) pratipadāyāṃ śaśiryathā || 7/2 ||
	śītalaṃ candrasaṃkāśaṃ vartistu ghṛtabodhitā |
	tatra caiva śikhā līnā asthicakre varānane || 7/3 ||
	bhāvayet keśaskandhasthaṃ lagnaṃ vai añjanantathā |
	sādravaṃ kṛṣṇarūpaṃ ca balīpalitanāśanam || 7/4 ||
	dvitīyaṃ sāmprataṃ devi śṛṇuṣvaikāgramānasā |
	ādhāraskandhasaṃsthāne yogaṃ yuñjīta śītalam || 7/5 ||
	līnaṃ vai brahmarandhre tu kṛṣṇāñjanadravātmakam |
	ādityaṃ śatruvat paśyet somaṃ vai mitravad yathā || 7/6 ||
	kṛṣṇāmbaradharo nityaṃ kṛṣṇadhyānātmarañjitam |
	bhūgṛhe nirjane sthāne daṃśamaśakavarjite || 7/7 ||
	na (sthāne) janasaṅkīrṇe sarpavyāghravivarjite |
	ekānte nirjane divye puṣpaprakaraṇaśobhite || 7/8 ||
	sugandhadhūpitaṃ kṛtvā śālyodanajitendriyaḥ |
	ṣaṇmāsāj jñāyate siddhiryoginīpadatatsamaḥ || 7/9 ||
	kāmadevasamaupamye surakanyāprapūjitam |
	brahmagranthisthitādyetāṃ trīṇi eva varānane || 7/10 ||
	līnāṃ vai brahmakhaṇḍe tu bhinnanīlāñjanaprabham |
	draveṇa rañjayet sarvaṃ romakūpādikaṃ priye || 7/11 ||
	dhyānena rañjitātmā tu vṛddho'pyunnatayauvanaḥ |
	bhavatyevanna sandehaḥ ṣaṇmāsābhyantareṇa tu || 7/12 ||
	piṅgagranthigatañcakraṃ ṣoḍaśāraṃ sutejasam |
	sādravaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇañca ṣoḍaśasvarabhūṣitam || 7/13 ||
	khadyotitagatādūrddhaṃ brahmarandhraṃ layaṃ gatāḥ |
	ṣaṇmāsāsevanābhyastād vṛddho'pi taruṇāyate || 7/14 ||
	bhavate nātra sandehaḥ kāmadevadvitīyakaḥ |
	yoginīsthānamāśritya asitaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇakam || 7/15 ||
	aṣṭapatradravañcaiva śītalaṃ candrasannibham |
	keśaskandhakapālasthaṃ rañjayet tasya tejasā || 7/16 ||
	abdārddhaṃ vatsaraṃ vāpi vṛddho'pi ṣoḍaśākṛtiḥ |
	jarāmaraṇanirmukto vyādhirogavivarjitaḥ || 7/17 ||
	yoginīgaṇasāmānyāsṛṣṭisaṃhārakārakaḥ |
	kaṇṭhakūpasthitodyotaṃ brahmarandhralayaṃ gatā || 7/18 ||
	sādravamañjanañcaiva romakūpādinirgatam |
	anaṅgasyaiva saubhāgyaṃ nigūḍhaṃ sandhibandhanam || 7/19 ||
	romāṇi satatantasya ghanāsthiṣu ca jāyate |
	prathame janavācchalyaṃ dvitīye rujanāśanam || 7/20 ||
	tṛtīye ca kavitvaṃ hi sālaṅkāramanoharam |
	caturthe vācakāmitvaṃ dūrāśravaṇaṃ pañcame || 7/21 ||
	bhūmityāgantavedhaṃ(?) ṣaṣṭhamanyat prakīrtitam |
	yoginīmelakatvañca saptame jāyate dhruvam || 7/22 ||
	jarāpaharaṇandevi aṣṭame bhavate priye |
	navame caṇḍavegatvaṃ daśame'nekarūpadhṛk || 7/23 ||
	ekādaśaguṇaṃ śāntaṃ trividhā caiva varjitam |
	ekādaśaguṇopetaṃ pūjyate'sau yathā śivam || 7/24 ||
	icchayārohaṇaṃ kuryādvarṇanaṃ nṛtyameva ca |
	yatastatraiva gantavyaṃ yatra vā rocate manaḥ || 7/25 ||
	manorodhaṃ na kartavyaṃ yadā jñātaṃ hi kaulikam |
	prapañcarahitaṃ śāstraṃ prapañcarahito guruḥ || 7/26 ||
	prapañcarahito mantraḥ prapañcarahitaḥ śivaḥ |
	etat kaulāgamaṃ nātha aprapañcaiḥ paśuḥ priye || 7/27 ||
	dambhitamātmanastaistu punardambhayate param |
	kecidajñānato naṣṭāḥ kecinnaṣṭāḥ pramādataḥ || 7/28 ||
	keci(j) jñānāvalayena kecinnaṣṭairvināśitāḥ |
	kampastobhe tathā roṣā mudrāmutpatanantathā || 7/29 ||
	bhavate nātra sandehaḥ saptarātreṇa kaulave |
	yāṃ yāṃ spṛśati hastena yāṃ yāṃ paśyati cakṣuṣā || 7/30 ||
	śuddhaṃ bhavati tat sarvaṃ parabindukiraṇāhatam |
	palitastambhavijñānaṃ kathitaṃ yoginīpriye || 7/31 ||
	devyā(ḥ) cakrādi deveśi brahmarandhrāvaśā(nu)gam |
	yuktaṃ kāmakalādevi palitastambhanaṃ param |
	etante kathitaṃ guhyaṃ unmanajñānanirṇitiḥ || 7/32 ||

[iti jñānanirṇitiyoginīkaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapadāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate saptamaḥ paṭamaḥ] || 7/7 ||




[aṣṭamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca 

	atyantagahanaṃ nātha sugopyaṃ guhyamuttamam |
	akule tu kulaṃ devaṃ kathaṃ jātaṃ hi bhairava || 8/1 ||
	kṣetrajā pīṭhajā vāpi yogajā mantrajā tathā |
	sahajā kulajā vāpi aṣṭāṣṭakamatantathā || 8/2 ||
	pūjākramavidhānantu kulasiddhaṃ vada prabho |
	gurupūjāvidhānantu sarvaṃ saṃkṣepato vada || 8/3 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	śṛṇuṣvaikāgracittantu yoginīvīramātare |
	ekānte vijane sthāne puṣpadāmopaśobhite || 8/4 ||
	sudhūpadhūpitaṃ kṛtvā matsyamāṃsarā (...) vam |
	bhakṣyabhojyasamāyukto madirānandasaṃyutam || 8/5 ||
	śaktiyukto mahātmānaḥ sahajā kulajāpi vā |
	antyajā vā mahādevi pṛthagbhedaṃ vadāmyaham || 8/6 ||
	vivāhaṃ tu kṛtaṃ yasya sahajā sa tu ucyate |
	kulajā veśyamityāhurantyajāvarṇa antyajā || 8/7 ||
	bahisthā kathitā devi ādhyātmyāṃ śṛṇu sāmpratam |
	gamyāgamyaprayogeṇa madanānandalakṣaṇam || 8/8 ||
	kurute dehamadhye tu sā śaktiḥ sahajā priye |
	kulajā kiṃ na vijñātā varṇarāśikulātmikām || 8/9 ||
	dehasthā trividhā proktā bahisthā trividhā priye |
	antyajā saṃpravakṣyāmi śṛṇu devi yathāsthitam || 8/10 ||
	śuddhasphaṭikasaṅkāśā muktāmālā khageśvarī |
	ūrddhatīryaksaṃśuddhā mahāśakti sutejasā || 8/11 ||
	eṣā śaktirmahātmāna antyajā vyomamālinī |
	tāmbulapūritaṃ vaktraṃ viliptaṃ muktamena ca || 8/12 ||
	śrīkhaṇḍaṃ mṛgamadañca hṛṣṭasaṃtuṣṭacetasā |
	yoginīvīrasaṃyuktaṃ yugmapātraṃ pṛthak pṛthak || 8/13 ||
	pūjayet tāṃ catuḥṣaṣṭiṃ pañcāśāṣṭakamevaca |
	raktāmbaradharāḥ sarve keyūrakaṭakojjvalāḥ || 8/14 ||
	yoginīvīracakrantu yathāśaktyā (pra)pūjayet |
	itthambhūtaṃ kulācāryaḥ kulaputrairadhiṣṭhitam || 8/15 ||
	pūjitavyā mahādevyā kṣetrajā tu vyavasthitāḥ |
	karavīraṃ mahākālaṃ devikoṭyaṃ varānane || 8/16 ||
	vārāṇasyāṃ prayāgantu caritraikāmrakantathā |
	aṭṭahāsaṃ jayantī ca ebhiḥ kṣetraiśca kṣetrajāḥ |
	teṣāṃ madhye pradhānantu ye jātāḥ kṣetrajā priye || 8/17 ||
