	aṣṭadhā tu likhedvidyā prathamāṣṭakabheditam |
	yathā etat tathā sarve jñātavyā yoginīkramam || 8/31 ||
	aṣṭāṣṭakaṃ vidhānena catuḥṣaṣṭi yathākramam |
	yoginīmelakaṃ cakraṃ aṇimādiguṇāṣṭakam || 8/32 ||
	bhavatyeva na sandeho dhyānapūjāratasya ca |
	dvitīyantu mahācakraṃ sarvākṛṣṭipravartakam || 8/33 ||
	paśugrahaṇamāveśaṃ pūjādhyānaratasya ca |
