	balīpalitanirmuktaḥ kāmadevo dvitīyakaḥ || 8/39 ||
	pañcamantu mahācakraṃ dhyānapūjākrameṇa tu |
	vāyvādernāśayedvācā mūkavat tiṣṭhate tu saḥ || 8/40 ||
	ṣaṣṭhaṃ caiva mahācakraṃ dharmārthakāmamokṣadam |
	saptamañcakraṃ deveśi sainyastambhakaraṃ param || 8/41 ||
	stobhāveśādikaṃ cakraṃ saṃsārabandhamocakam |
	dūrācca darśanaṃ tasmin pūjādhyānaratasya tu || 8/42 ||
	aṣṭamaṃ cakramuddiṣṭaṃ icchāsiddhipravartakam |
	māraṇoccāṭanaṃ bhadre stambhamohādikaṃ priye || 8/43 ||
