[navamaḥ paṭalaḥ]


bhairava uvāca 


gurupaṅktiṃ pravakṣyāmi siddhapaṅktiṃ sulocane |
	yoginīpañktivinyāsaṃ kathayāmi tava priye || 9/1 ||
	sarvasiddhiyoginīnāṃ khecarīṃ sarvamātarīm |
	sarvabhūcarīsarvagocarayoginīnāṃ sarvakṣetrakam || 9/2 ||
	sarvamantrajāḥ sarvayogajāḥ sarvapīṭhajāḥ |
	sarvasahajāḥ sarvakulajā sarvadvārapālikāḥ || 9/3 ||
	sarvagarbhajāḥ kṛte ca dvāpare trete kaliyuge mahātape |
	caturyugavibhāgena yoginīsiddhipūjitāḥ ||
	guhyānāṃ paramaṃ guhyantava bhaktyā prakāśitam || 9/4 ||


devyuvāca


	sudagdhamagninā deham adya nirvāpitaṃ param |
	tava prasādāt kauleśa jñāto'ham jñānanirṇayam |
	sāmprataṃ śrotumicchāmi gurubhyaḥ siddhapūjanam || 9/5 ||


bhairava uvāca


	gurusiddhividhe devi śṛṇu tvaṃ kulabhāvini |

	śrīviśvapādān | (śrī) vicitrapādān | śrīśvetapādān | 
śrībhaṭṭapādān | śrīmachendrapādān | śrībṛhīṣapādān | 
śrīviṃdhyapādān | śrīśabarapādān | śrīmahendrapādān | śrīcandrapādān | 
śrīhiḍinipādān | śrīsamudrapādān | śrīlavaṇapādān | śrīdumbarapādān | 
śrīdeṇepādān | śrīdhīvarapādān | śrīsiṃhalapādān |
 (śrī) oginīpādān guru paramaguru parameṣṭhya pūjya mahāpūjya lākinī 
ḍākinī śākinī kākinī yākinī (-)

	hrīṃkāramāditaḥ kṛtvā śrīkāraṃ caitadanantaram |
	akṣaradvayavinyāsamanyanteṣu pradāpayet || 9/6 ||
	etat siddhāśca yoginyā asmin siddhāḥ kulāgame |
	anena sadṛśaṃ jñānaṃ na bhūyo na bhaviṣyati || 9/7 ||
	kaliyuge mahāghore raurave'tyantabhīṣaṇe |
	sañjātāḥ ṣoḍaśa siddhā asmin kaule sulocane |
	kṛte ca dvāpare trete siddhāyai vīravanditāḥ |
	teṣāṃ nāmavidhiṃ vakṣye śṛṇu tvaṃ varalocane || 9/8 ||

	mṛṣṇipādāḥ | avatārapādāḥ | sūryapādāḥ | dyutipādāḥ | 
omapādāḥ | vyāghrapādāḥ | hariṇipādāḥ | pañcaśikhipādāḥ | 
komalapādāḥ | lambodarapādāḥ |

	ete pūrvamahāsiddhāḥ kulakaulāvatārakāḥ |
	caturyugeti deveśa svatantra (-) kulacodakā (ḥ) || 9/9 ||
	asya jñānaprabhāveṇa bahavaḥ sidhyanti mānavāḥ |
	daśakoṭipramāṇantu i(da)m kaulaṃ parodbhavam || 9/10 ||
	sārātsārataraṃ bhadre mahākaulasya śobhane |
	icchākhyā yoginī siddhairmāyāntaṃ para(-)icchayā || 9/11 ||
	khecarīṇāṃ punaḥ paścādicchayā prakaṭīkṛtam |
	mātarāṇāṃ punardevi khecaraiḥ kathitaṃ priye || 9/12 ||
	mātarāṇi gamiṣyanti bhūcarīṇāṃ kuleśvari |
	bhūcarīṇāṃ subhakṣāṇāṃ bhūcarī kathitaṃ priye || 9/13 ||
	yoginīnāṃ kule jātau labhate kaulikī sphūṭam |
	caturaśīti sahasreṣu yoniyantreṣu pīḍitāḥ || 9/14 ||
	puṇyātmānaṃ kulāścaryaṃ paścāj jñānamimāṃ labhet |
	bhuktimuktimahāsiddhiḥ yoginīnāṃ priyo bhavet || 9/15 ||


[iti jñānanirṇitiyogiṇīmahākaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate navamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 9/9 ||



[daśamaḥ paṭalaḥ]


devyuvāca


	adya me saphalaṃ nātha mama piṇḍaṃ sureśvara |
	vahnināveṣṭitātmānamekapādena saṃsthitam || 10/1 ||
	tattapaḥ saphalaṃ me'dya tvayā tuṣṭena bhairava |
	jñānasya nirṇayandeva adya me prakaṭīkṛtam || 10/2 ||
	punaḥ pṛcchāmi kauleśa yathātathyaṃ vada prabho |
	aṣṭāṣṭakavibhāgantu parijñātumanantathā || 10/3 ||
	adyāpi saṃśayo nātha teṣāṃ cakraṃ pṛthak pṛthak |
	guhyasthānaṃ yathācakraṃ kṣipraṃ sidhyati bhairava || 10/4 ||
	sthānadhyānaphalanteṣāṃ saṃkṣepaṃ kathyate prabho |


bhairava uvāca 


	sādhu sādhu mahādevi pṛṣṭo'haṃ suradurlabham || 10/5 ||
	kathayāmi na sandeho bhaktiyuktā varānane |

	lāṃ līṃ lūṃ ḷṃ luṃ laiṃ lauṃ laḥ | hāṃ hīṃ hūṃ hṛṃ h haiṃ 
hauṃ (haḥ) | sāṃ sīṃ sūṃ sṛṃ slaṃ (saiṃ) sauṃ saḥ | ṣāṃ ṣīṃ ṣūṃ 
ṣṛṃ ṣlaṃ ṣaiṃ ṣauṃ ṣaḥ | śāṃ śīṃ śūṃ śṛṃ ślaṃ śaiṃ śauṃ śaḥ | 
vāṃ vīṃ vūṃ vṛṃ vlaṃ vaiṃ vauṃ vaḥ | hlāṃ hlīṃ hluṃ hḷṃ hlaiṃ 
hlauṃ hlaḥ || 10/

	kṣakāraṃ brahmarandhratvaṃ laṃkārantu lalāṭayoḥ || 10/6 ||
	hakārantu bhruvormadhye sakāraṃ vaktramaṇḍale |
	ṣakāraṃ kaṇṭhadeśe tu śakāraṃ hṛdaye tadā || 10/7 ||
	vakāraṃ nābhimadhye tu hlakāraṃ visakandayo (ḥ) |
	sthānacakrāstu saṃproktāsteṣāṃ dhyānaṃ śṛṇu priye || 10/8 ||
	śuddhasphaṭikasaṅkāśaṃ ūrddhvatejasunirmalam |
	aṣṭāraṃ paṅkajaṃ divyaṃ prathamāṣṭakabhūṣitam || 10/9 ||
	sarvadvandvavinirmuktaṃ krodhāgraiḥ śūnyavarjitam |
	abhyāsāt samacittastu grāmadharmañca varjayet || 10/10 ||
	atītānāgatañcaiva vartamānantathaiva ca |
	dūrāśravaṇavijñānaṃ pāśastobhantathā priye || 10/11 ||
	paśugrahaṇamāveśaṃ mṛtyunāśantathaiva ca |
	amaratvantathā devi samāsāt parivartanam || 10/12 ||
	vācā siddhirbhavatyevaṃ kiṃ kurvāṇaṃ jagatpriye |
	dvitīyamaṣṭapatrantu tejadhyānasudīpitam || 10/13 ||
	āgamānnāśayenmṛtyuṃ purakṣobhādikārakaḥ |
	kurute bahudhā rūpaṃ dhyānaikagatacetasaḥ || 10/14 ||
	maṇḍalīkanarendrāṇāṃ kiṃ kurvāṇo vidhīyate |
	kruddhastu saṃharet sarvaṃ trailokyaṃ sacarācaram || 10/15 ||
	sṛṣṭisaṃhārakartāraṃ nityābhyāsarataḥ sadā |
	tṛtīyantu mahācakraṃ navatattvapramocakaḥ || 10/16 ||
	ṣaṇmāsādīpsitaṃ kāmaṃ dhyātvādhārantu tadguruḥ |
	balīpalitanāśantu sudūrāddarśanantathā || 10/17 ||
	bedhantu kurute devi yojanānāṃ śatairapi |
	ekānte bahudhā rūpaṃ kuru dhyānañca tatparaḥ || 10/18 ||
	caturthaśāntikaṃ cakraṃ sukhaprītivivarddhanam |
	kurute amaratvaṃ hi satatābhyāsatatparaḥ || 10/19 ||
	vācayo kurute mṛtyuṃ rogāṇāntu jayaṃ priye |
	divasānnāśanenaiva vayo mṛtyuṃ gamiṣyate || 10/20 ||
	nāśayedaho(rā)treṇa etañcakramanuttamam |
	satatābhyāsayogena dviraṣṭavarṣākṛtirbhavet || 10/21 ||
	aṣṭapatraṃ mahāpadmaṃ pañcamaṃ surasundari |
	dhūmravarṇaṃ sadā cintya trailokyaṃ cālayet priye || 10/22 ||
	vācāpahāraṃ kurute sainyastambhakaraṃ param |
	ṣaṣṭhaṃ tu cakraṃ rājānamaṣṭapatrasakarṇikam || 10/23 ||
	taptacāmīkaraprabhamicchāsiddhipravartakam |
	atītānāgatañcaiva aṇimādiguṇāṣṭakam || 10/24 ||
	dadate nātra sandeho bhaktidhyānapradīpitaḥ |
	saptamantu mahādevi pūrṇacandraprabhaṃ priye || 10/25 ||
	tadgatantanmanaṃ bhadre bhuktimuktipradaṃ śubham |
	jarāmṛtyuvināśañca paradehe praveśanam || 10/26 ||
	kiṃ kurvāṇavidheyastu maṇḍalīkanarottama (ḥ) |
	aṣṭamantu mahācakraṃ patrāṣṭakavibhūṣitam || 10/27 ||
	dharmakāmārthamokṣañca dadatyeva sulocane |
	raktadhyāne sadāvaśyaṃ pītastambhakaraṃ param || 10/28 ||
	śuklamādhyāyana devi sphaṭike mokṣadāyikam |
	kṛṣṇena māraṇaṃ proktaṃ dhūmramuccāṭane sadā || 10/29 ||
	gokṣīradhāradhavalaṃ etanmṛtyuñjayo hitam |
	puraḥkṣobhantatastobhaṃ kampapātādikaṃ caret || 10/30 ||
	agnijvālā sudīptābhaṃ dhyānaṃ caivāṣṭamaṃ sadā |
	ekaikasya sthitandevi etaddhyānantu aṣṭadhā || 10/31 ||
	cāpañca kañcukī devi praṇipatya muhurmuhuḥ |
	adya me saphalaṃ jātammahākauleṣu bhairava || 10/32 ||


[iti jñānanirṇitiyoginīkaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate daśamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 10/10 ||



[ekādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca


	kathayasva mahādeva carukādvaitalakṣaṇam |
	sarvaśaṅkāvinirmuktaṃ niḥśaṅkaṃ sidhyate dhruvam || 11/1 ||


bhairava uvāca


	yattvayā pṛcchitaṃ devi loke'smin krūrabhīṣaṇe |
	kathayāmi niḥsandehaṃ sarvaśaṅkāvimardakaḥ || 11/2 ||
	advaite nityayuktasya tasya siddhiḥ prajāyate |
	dvaitantu kārayedyastu ākṛṣṭo yogibhistu saḥ || 11/3 ||
	samayād bhraṣṭantu yo devi sa paśurnātra saṃśayaḥ |
	dvaitabhāvaṃ parityajya advaitācārabhāvitaḥ || 11/4 ||
	pañcāmṛtaṃ pravakṣyāmi guhyānāṃ guhyamuttamam |
	jñātavyaṃ kulasamayaṃ kulaputrairviśeṣataḥ || 11/5 ||
	sādhakaiḥ siddhikāmaistu tathānyaṃ kuladeśikaiḥ |
	anuṣṭhitamidaṃ pūrvaṃ kulasiddhaiḥ sulocane || 11/6 ||
	etajjñātvā bhavet siddhirmānasī yoginīpriye |
	yadicchet kaulavī siddhiḥ prāpya pañcāmṛtaṃ param || 11/7 ||
	tadā sidhyati yoginyāṃ siddhimelāpakaṃ bhavet |
	dadante ca tadā devi carukaṃ pañcabhiryutam || 11/8 ||
	yoginībhiḥ sakṛddattaṃ tatkṣaṇāt tatsamo bhavet |
	atha vā prāśayejjñātvā yogayuktastu kaulavit || 11/9 ||
	sidhyate nātra sandeho vighnajālavivarjitam |
	yoginīgaṇasāmānyāmanaḥ sucintitaṃ bhavet || 11/10 ||
	viṣṭhaṃ dhārāmṛtaṃ śukraṃ raktamajjāvimiśritam |
	etat pañca pavitrāṇi nityameva kulāgame || 11/11 ||
	nityanaimittikaṃ devi kartavyaṃ ca prayatnataḥ |
	gomāṃsaṃ goghṛtaṃ raktaṃ gokṣīrañca dadhintathā || 11/12 ||
	naimittike imaṃ kuryāt siddhikāme mahotsukaḥ |
	niḥśaṅko nirvikalpastu etat kuryāt kulāgame || 11/13 ||
	anyathā naiva sidhyanti nirmuktistu mama priye |
	punaranyaviśeṣaṇaṃ śṛṇuṣvaikāgramānasaḥ || 11/14 ||
	śvānamārjāra (-) uṣṭrañca śṛgālañca hayantathā (?) |
	kūrmakacchavarāhañca mārjāravakakarkaṭam || 11/15 ||
	śalākī kukuṭaścāpi bahu(?)nānākulantathā |
	śerakañca mṛgaṃ vāpi mahiṣaṃ gaṇḍakaṃ tathā || 11/16 ||
	anyāni yāni macchāni yathālābhaṃ samāharet |
	vijñānambalasāmarthyaṃ saptajanmāntikaṃ paśu || 11/17 ||
	yena tena prakāreṇa ākṛṣṭiṃ bhakṣayet sadā |
	pūjayed yoginīvṛndaṃ bhakṣyabhojyādibhiḥ priye || 11/18 ||
	dhārāpānantataḥ kuryād yadīccheccirajīvitum |
	piśitaṃ trividhaṃ kuryāt pakṣāmlamadhurantathā || 11/19 ||
	devatātarpaṇārthāya surā deyā yathocitā |
	vṛkṣajā mūlajā caiva puṣpajā phalajāpi vā || 11/20 ||
	peṣṭī mādhvī tathā gauṇḍī dadyānnaimittike priye |
	advaitantu yathākhyātaṃ kartavyaṃ nānyathā na hi || 11/21 ||
	advaitācāramāsṛtya yadānyañcarati pāpakṛt |
	patanti narake ghore avīciraurave tathā || 11/22 ||
	advaitaṃ yena santyaktaṃ mamābhāṣyantu(?) taṃ paśum |
	yoginīgaṇamadhyasthaṃ sa paśuḥ kīrtitaṃ kule || 11/23 ||
	guptaṃ guptataraṃ kuryād gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
	jananījāragarbhantu svaputraṃ gopayedyathā || 11/24 ||
	advaitaṃ gopayennityaṃ sugopyamabhyaset kramāt |
	aṇimādiguṇaiśvaryasiddhiśca mānasī bhavet || 11/25 ||
	svayaṃ guruḥ svayaṃ siddhaḥ svayaṃ śiṣyaḥ svayaṃ śivaḥ |
	ajñānabandhanājñeyaṃ jñānaṃ jñeyaṃ vimocanam || 11/26 ||
	sugandhaṃ pūtigandhañca nityaṃ gṛhṇāti niṣkalaḥ |
	padmapatre yathā toye tathā caivaṃ na lipyate || 11/27 ||
	tadvanna lipyate yogī puṇyapāpaiḥ sureśvari |
	brahmahatyādikaṃ pāpam aśvamedhādikaṃ phalam || 11/28 ||
	sarvatīrthābhiṣekañca mlecchādisparśanena tu |
	etairna gṛhyate yogī kriyamāṇairapi sphuṭam || 11/29 ||
	samatvaṃ vītarāgatvamudāsīnāṃ kha(-)vṛttinām |
	niṣparigrahasantoṣaṃ dvandvayogaṃ na kārayet || 11/30 ||
	kāmakrodhañca dambhañca tyajellobhaṃ śanaiḥ śanaiḥ |
	na carunnindayedbhadre samayādvaitameva ca || 11/31 ||
	yasminniṣpadyate piṇḍaṃ raktaśukraṃ pibet sadā |
	siddhānāṃ yoginīnāñca imañcarumpriyaṃ sadā || 11/32 ||
	śākinīnāṃ priyaṃ māṃsaṃ devīnāñca priyaṃ śṛṇu |
	vukapuṣpaṃ śivāmbuñca raktaśukraṃ surāntathā || 11/33 ||
	brahmaniṣṭhīvanādyañca saurabhyaṃ puṣpakādikam |
	gandhaṃ dhūpañca geyañca tāmbūlaṃ raktavāsasam || 11/34 ||
	rakṣādyaṃ raktavarṇañca siddhānāṃ devatā priye |
	vijñānonmīlanambhadre bhavatyevaṃ nānyasevanāt || 11/35 ||
	śākaraṃ yanna kurvīta janmahīnavarastriyai |
	laulyārthī capalā nityaṃ kulaśāstraviḍambakam || 11/36 ||
	svaśaktidarśanādraktaṃ sparśanāllakṣaṇena tu |
	kulavijñānasaṃbhogāt ṣaṇmāsāt siddhibhājanaḥ || 11/37 ||
	ādimantravinirmuktaṃ śivāmbu brahmameva ca |
	prāśayet tat sadā kālaṃ yoginīmelako bhavet || 11/38 ||
	pādaprakṣālanantena nityaṃ tat tathaiva ca |
	mukhaprakṣālanaṃ nityaṃ brahmaṇorddhagatampriye || 11/39 ||
	kuṇḍagolodbhavannaiva tilakaṃ kārayet sadā |
	aśītiṃ nāśayedvātān kuṣṭhavyādhintu nāśayet || 11/40 ||
	mucyate sarvarogaiśca yathā sarpasya kañcukam |
	udayārkasamastejannityaṃ vai yoginīpriyam || 11/41 ||
	trailokyaṃ vaśyatāṃ yāti brahmādayo divaukasaḥ |
	carukādvaitamācāraṃ mantrajaiḥ (?) saha bhojanam || 11/42 ||
	sarvaṃ samācared devi icchāśaktreradhiṣṭhitam |
	icchāṃ vinā na kuryāttu balātkāreṇa tañcarum |
	carukādvaitamācāraṃ kathitaṃ jñānanirṇayam || 11/43 ||


[iti jñānanirṇitiyogiṇīmahākaulammahacchrīmacchaghnapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate ekādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 11/11 ||



[dvādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ]


devyuvāca


	romāñcakañcukā devi hṛṣṭasantuṣṭacetasaḥ |
	bhakṣyāṇāntu samutpannaṃ punaḥ pṛcchāmi bhairava || 12/1 ||
	adyāhaṃ kulasamayamadyāhaṃ lakṣaṇānvitam |
	sāmprataṃ śrotumicchāmi pātrāṇāṃ caryalakṣaṇam || 12/2 ||


bhairava uvāca


	śṛṇu tvaṃ vīracāmuṇḍe pātrāṇāṃ caryalakṣaṇam |
	prathamaṃ bālarūpeṇa dvitīyam unmattakākṛtim || 12/3 ||
	tṛtīyaṃ rājarūpeṇa caturthaṃ kaśmalaṃ priye |
	svātantraṃ pañcamaṃ devi ṣaṣṭhañca vīranāyakam || 12/4 ||
	gandharvasaptamannāma nagnaṃ caivāṣṭakaṃ priye |
	tridaṇḍañcaiva deveśastathānyaṃ vedavikrayam || 12/5 ||
	yāṃ yāntu kurute icchāṃ tāṃ tāñcaiva vrataṃ priye |
	akulañca kulaṃ jñātvā kulaṃ devyā subhāmini || 12/6 ||
	bhairavaṃ pūjitavyañca kulaiḥ siddhisamanvitam |
	svaguruṃ pujayennityaṃ triṣkālaṃ bhāvitātmanaḥ || 12/7 ||
	manasā karmaṇā vācā guruñcaiva svakaṃ na tu |
	nivedayet prayatnena bhuktimuktijigīṣayā || 12/8 ||
	gurukaulāgame bhakti advaitācārabhāvitaḥ |
	īpsitaṃ tu vrataṃ kuryādadvaitena samanvitam || 12/9 ||

devyuvāca

	caryāyā lakṣaṇaṃ deva prasādādavadhāritam |
	punaḥ pṛcchāmi deveśa pātrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ śubham || 12/10 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	pātrāṇāṃ nirṇayaṃ devi śṛṇuṣvekāgramānasaḥ |
	mṛnmayaṃ kūrmajaṃ devi kāṃsajaṃ tāmralohajam || 12/11 ||
	hemajaṃ raupyajaṃ vāpi śuktijaṃ śaṅkhajaṃ priye |
	kaulikaṃ tu varārohe tathānyaṃ kācasambhavam || 12/12 ||
	śṛṅgodbhavaṃ sakāṣṭhādyāpāṣāṇasambhavaṃ priye |
	viśvāmitrakapālañca sarvapātrottamaṃ priye || 12/13 ||
	tasmin kṛtvā pibet kiñcidbhakṣyañca bhakṣayed yadi |
	patiñca patitañca tadbhaveccakottamaḥ (?) || 12/14 ||
	jñātavyaṃ pātrametadviśālaṃ nārikelakam |
	etat pātramalābhena anyapātre pibet surām || 12/15 ||
	pātrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ devi caryāyāścaiva lakṣaṇam |
	kathitaṃ devi sadbhāvaṃ kimanyaṃ pṛcchase'dhunā || 12/16 ||

devyuvāca

	adya me saphalaṃ jātā devatvaṃ svaranāyika |
	tatprasādena deveśa jñātavyaṃ jñānanirṇayam || 12/17 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye śrīyoginīkaulammahacchrīmachaghnapādāvatārite 
caryāpātralakṣaṇo dvādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 12/12 ||




[trayodaśaḥ paṭalaḥ]

bhairava uvāca

	mokṣapratyayasaṃvitti śṛṇu tvaṃ vīranāyike |
	adhorddhañca labhejjīvo jñātvā taṃ muktibhojanam || 13/1 ||
	haṃsa haṃsa vadennityaṃ dehasthāvarajaṅgame |
	śrutvā tasya patirdivyaṃ yāti mokṣavaraṃ śubham || 13/2 ||
	yena vyāptaṃ ca trailokyaṃ jagad yasmin vyavasthitam |
	taṃ jñātvā gūḍhasadbhāvaṃ sarvajñatvamprajāyate || 13/3 ||
	na tena vinā mucyante vyavahārānna hi tadvinā |
	śubhāśubhaṃ ca saṃbhoktaṃ na tena rahitaṃ kvacit || 13/4 ||
	na manañcittamālabdhaṃ na peyaṃ dhāraṇaṃ priye |
	unmanantu mano yasya tasya mokṣo bhavantīha || 13/5 ||
	dvādaśānte yadā paśyet sphūrantaṃ maṇimālikā |
	tasya mokṣo bhavedyastu pāpapuṇyairna lipyate || 13/6 ||
	devayāne mahāyāne yasya cittaṃ sadā priye |
	tasya mokṣo na sandehaḥ padmapatrāmbubinduvat || 13/7 ||
	i gude ikṣu meḍhre iyau nābhau || imau vaktre ||
	ivau dakṣiṇanāsā(yāṃ) || ilau vāmapuṭe || irau dakṣiṇataḥ ||
	iḍo dakṣiṇakarṇaḥ || iśau vāma karṇaḥ ||
	ihrau bhrūmadhye || saṃ taṃ lalāṭe || saṃ aṃ vāmakarṇe ||
	saḥ yaṃ dakṣiṇakarṇaḥ || saḥ paṃ vāmacakṣuḥ ||
	saḥ ṛ dakṣiṇacakṣuḥ ||
	vaḥ taṃ vāmanāsikā || saḥ puṃ dakṣiṇanāsikā ||
	saḥ rūṃ vaktram || saḥ yaṃ nābhi || saḥ ṣu/ meḍhraḥ ||
	saḥ laṃ gude ||
	idaṃ nyāsakramandevi yasya dehe pravartate |
	tasya mokṣo na sandehaḥ paraṃ saṃvittipūrvakam ||
	piṇḍapāte yadā devi kapālambhidyate tadā || 13/8 ||


