	pañcāramaṣṭapatrañca ṣoḍaśāraṃ suśobhanam || 15/13 ||
	ṣoḍaśāraṃ trilikhyantu antarālasamanvitam |
	aṣṭārapadmapatrañca ṣoḍaśaikaṃ varānane || 15/14 ||
	binducchindañca kartavyaṃ antarāla(ma)pi suvrate |
	ṣoḍaśākṣarabhinnantu ātmā vai prāṇasaṃyutaḥ || 15/15 ||
	ṣoḍaśākṣarabhedantu ūrddhaṃ cakre vyavasthitam |
	catuṣkalaṃ punardevi anyathā na kadācana || 15/16 ||
	ādhāre ca ātmacakraṃ (.....) tadūrddhagam |
	karṇikāyātmanaḥ kṛtvā ūrddhacakreṇa plāvayet || 15/17 ||
	gokṣīraviplutairdevi plāvyamānaṃ saviplaṣaiḥ |
	dviraṣṭavarṣamātmānaṃ adhaścakre vyavasthitam || 15/18 ||
	kiñciddarśitavarṇābhaṃ prāṇacakraṃ sulocane |
	plāvayet pūrvacakreṇa pūrṇacandranibhaṃ tanu || 15/19 ||
	ānayenniścalībhūtam asthicakrodbhavena tu |
	plāvayitvā jagat sarvaṃ trayacakraṃ samabhyaset || 15/20 ||
	āramūrddhiṃcakrantu tadūrddhe caiva pārvati |
	nalīkāyāṃ garbhalīnaṃ saṃhārantu kutaḥ priye || 15/21 ||
	balīpalitanirmukto jvaravyādhivivarjitaḥ |
	akṣayo hyamaro nityo yathārhantiṣṭa mānasaḥ (?) || 15/22 ||
	yadā bhavati saṃhārastadā paśyeccarācaram |
	tadā'sau tiṣṭhate bhadre mayā sārddhaṃ svareśvari || 15/23 ||
	yathā mahyaṃ prabhutvañca trailokyaṃ sacarācaram |
	tadvat sa bhavate devi sṛṣṭisaṃhārakārakaḥ || 15/24 ||
	samacittaṃ sadā līnamasthicakraṃ sulocane |
	vajravattiṣṭhata dehaṃ saṃhā(ra)ntu na hi priye || 15/25 ||
	mayābhyasta(mi)dampūrvantenāhamakṣayaṃ priye |
	etanmayā kathitaṃ śāstre aprameyamanekadhā || 15/26 ||
	imantu gūḍhasadbhāvaṃ mama guhyaṃ pragopitam |
	gopanīyaṃ prayatnena saptādūrddhanna dāpayet |
	etatte kulasadbhāvammayā tubhyamprakāśitam || 15/27 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye yoginīkaulammahacchīmacchendrapādāvātārite 
candradvīpavinirgate paramavajrīkaraṇaṃ nāma pañcadaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 15/15 ||



[ṣoḍaśaḥ paṭalaḥ]


devyuvāca


	yoginīsiddhasampannaṃ divyarūpeṇa bhairava |
	krīḍate mātṛmadhyasthaṃ svaśaktiṃ balagarvaitam || 16/1 ||
	durvijñeyaṃ sadā nātha tubhyaṃ caritaceṣṭitam |
	na jñātaṃ suragāndharvaiḥ kiṃ punarbhuvi sambhavaiḥ || 16/2 ||
	triṣkālaṃ tiṣṭhase kṣetre kṣetraṃ vā pīṭhaparvate |
	tanmamācakṣva deveśa bhakṣyāṇāṃ divyadarśanam |
	atidhyānavidaṃ deva kathyatāntu mama prabho || 16/3 ||


bhairava uvāca 


	śobhanaṃ pṛcchitaṃ bhadre adbhutasiddhigocare |
	kathyamānaṃ viśālākṣi kiṃ bhayaṃ tejabhāmini || 16/4 ||
	śrīśailaśca mahendraśca pīṭhakā(mā)khya viśrutam |
	sannidhāno hyahaṃ bhadre triṣkālasiddhimelakam || 16/5 ||
	prasannā ye narā bhadre vyomadhyānaikacetasaḥ |
	darśanaṃ ca bhavate tasmin mayā sārddhaṃ kuleśvari || 16/6 ||
	śrīśaile nāma saṃsiddhirmahendre rājasaṃ smṛtam |
	sādhvikaṃ yogasaṃyukto kāmākhyaṃ pīṭhamāsmṛtam || 16/7 ||
	tasmin melāpakaṃ labdhvā yoginīsiddhiḥ tatsamam |
	manasā cintitaṃ rūpaṃ aṇimādiguṇāṣṭakam || 16/8 ||
	kintvayā tena vijñātaṃ mahyaṃ caritaceṣṭitam |
	kathitaṃ melakaṃ sthānaṃ śrutaṃ te ceṣṭitaṃ śubham || 16/9 ||
	pañcasrotātmakaṃ caiva gopitaṃ siddhigocaram |
	abhakṣyā codyate nāthe anyathā na kadācana || 16/10 ||
	ahantat paramaṃ tattvaṃ ahaṃ sa bhairavaḥ priye |
	ahaṃ sadā śiva īśaḥ śrīkaṇṭho rudra eva ca || 16/11 ||
	ahaṃ so dhīvaro devī ahaṃ vīreśvaraḥ priye || 16/12 ||
	ananto'ham mahādevi rudro'haṃ surasundari |
	saṃharāmi jagat sarvaṃ saṃhāro'haṃ kuleśvari || 16/13 ||
	carācaraḥ punaḥ sṛṣṭiḥ straṣṭāro dhīravandite |
	vihitaṃ trāyate nityaṃ vidhātā'haṃ kulāgame || 16/14 ||
	viśvantu niśṛtaṃ yena viśvapādeti gīyate |
	vicitracitratāsṛṣṭirvicitreti ca viśrute || 16/15 ||
	svecchayā krīḍito'haṃ ca karoti vikaroti ca |
	śvetapādastvahaṃ devi śvetapādeti gīyate || 16/16 ||
	candrakāntasamaṃ tejaṃ bhṛṅgavarṇaṃ sunirmalam |
	te cāhaṃ viśrute loke bhṛṅgapādā varaprade || 16/17 ||
	asurāṇāṃ surāṇāṃ ca ahaṃ bhaṭṭārakaḥ priye |
	bhaṭṭapādeti vikhyāto nāmedaṃ mama sundari || 16/18 ||
	śriyāmutkaṇṭhitā ye tu śrīkaṇṭhastena ucyate |
	rūrūpādaṃ mahādevi rūdro'haṃ drāvaṇapriye || 16/19 ||
	(rūrūpādaṃ mahādevi mahīdrāvaṇaṃ priye |)
	tva(-)umātu mahādevi tubhyaṃ patirahaṃ priye || 16/20 ||
	śriyāyā tu ahannātha śrīnātha siddhagocare |
	yadāvatāritaṃ jñānaṃ kāmarūpī tvayā mayā |
	tadāvatāritaṃ tubhyaṃ tattvantu ṣaṇmukhasya ca || 16/21 ||
	tena kaulāgame devi vijñānaṃ praṇavapriye |
	avyaktena tu rūpeṇa candradvīpe ahaṃ priye ||
	avyaktaṃ gocaraṃ tena kulajātaṃ mama priye || 16/22 ||


śrīdevyuvāca


	kimarthaṃ candradvīpantu ahañcaiva gataḥ prabho |
	kimarthaṃ grasitā prājñā ādiṣaṇmukhasya ca || 16/23 ||
	anyo'pi vismayo devi kaulave siddhimicchatā |
	sūcitaṃ sūcanārthāya vaṭuko nāma nāmataḥ ||
	kiṃ varṇā dhyānamātrañca śrotumicchāmi bhairava || 16/24 ||


bhairava uvāca 


	ātmānaṃ budhyase nātha yadyapi priyabhāṣiṇi |
	icchā tvaṃ jñānaśaktiśca kriyākhyā caiva bhāsini || 16/25 ||
	gaurī caiva mahākālī lakṣmī caiva śriyā tayā |
	ahaṃ tvaṃ ca viśālākṣi sarvaśāstrāvatārakaḥ || 16/26 ||
	ahaṃ caiva tvayā sārddhaṃ candradvipaṃ gato yadā |
	tadā vaṭukarūpeṇa kārtikeya(ḥ) samāgataḥ || 16/27 ||
	ajñānabhāvamāsṛtya tadā śāstraṃ hi mūṣitam |
	śāsito'haṃ mayā devi ṣaṇmukhā mṛṣakātṛkam || 16/28 ||
	gato'haṃ sāgaraṃ bhadre jñānadṛṣṭyāvalokanam |
	macchamākarṣayitvā tu sphoṭitaṃ codaraṃ priye || 16/29 ||
	gṛhītvā matsyodarasthantu ānītantu gṛhī punaḥ |
	sthāpayitvā jñānapaṭṭaṃ mama gūḍhaṃ tu rakṣitam || 16/30 ||
	punaḥ kruddhamanenaiva muṣakeṇa sureśvari |
	gārtaṃ kṛtvā suruṅgāya punaḥ kṣiptaṃ hi sāgare || 16/31 ||
	daśakoṭipramāṇena mahāmāṃsena bhakṣitam |
	mama krodha samutpannaṃ śaktijālo mayā kṛtaḥ || 16/32 ||
	ākarṣito matsyasptānāṃ sāgarahradāt |
	nāgato'sau mahāmatsyā mama tulyabalaḥ priye || 16/33 ||
	jñānatejena saṃbhūto durjayastridaśairapi |
	brahmatvaṃ hi tadā tyaktaṃ cittavī (?) dhīvarātmakam || 16/34 ||
	ahaṃ so dhīvaro devi kaivartatvaṃ mayā kṛtaḥ |
	ākṛṣya tu tadā matsyaṃ śaktijālasamīkṛtaḥ || 16/35 ||
	matsyodarantu tatsphoṭya gṛhītañca kulāgame |
	vadanti viditā loke paśavo jñānavarjitāḥ || 16/36 ||


devyuvāca 


	brāhmaṇo'si mahāpuṇye kaivartatvaṃ mayā kṛtaḥ |
	matsyābhighātinairviprā matsyaghnameti viśrutāḥ |
	kaivartatvaṃ kṛtaṃ yasmāt kaivarto vipranāyakaḥ || 16/37 ||


bhairava uvāca


	avyaktena mahātmāna kṛtaṃ pūrvantu sundari |
	avyaktagocaraṃ tena kulairjātammahākṛpe || 16/38 ||
	tubhyañcaiva mahādevi ṣaṭmukhasya ca pārvati |
	vighneśo nandinaścaiva mahākālasya dhīmate || 16/39 ||
	jayā ca vijayādīnāṃ harasiddhimahābalāḥ |
	kālikā yoginī khyātā ūrddhato matsamaṃ priye || 16/40 ||
	akulaṃ tu imaṃ bhadre yatrāhaṃ tiṣṭhate tadā |
	kalpānte ca yugānte ca mama dehe tu tiṣṭhati || 16/41 ||
	jīvamadhye yadā devi puṣpamūlaphalānvitā |
	patraśākhāsamāyukto vṛkṣasya codbhavaṃ yathā || 16/42 ||
	tadvadutpāditānye'pi maddehe kulabhāmini |
	ajñānabhāvitā devi paśutvaṃ suranāyike || 16/43 ||
	gṛhītvā tu punardevi mahājñānaṃ prakīrtitam |
	kathitaṃ tava kāmeṣi ṣaṭmukhasya gaṇasya ca || 16/44 ||
	nandī caiva mahākāle jayā ca vijayādiṣu |
	bhaṭṭādyā droṇakādīnāṃ tathā ca harasiddhikā || 16/45 ||
	kathitaṃ kālikā yogī sarvakaulasya nirṇayam |
	bhaktiyuktā samatvena sarve śṛṇvantu kaulikam || 16/46 ||
	mahākaulāt siddhakaulaṃ siddhakaulāt masādaram (?) |
	caturyugavibhāgena avatārañcoditaṃ mayā || 16/47 ||
	jñānadau nirṇītiḥ kaulaṃ dvitīye mahat saṃjñitam |
	tṛtīye siddhāmṛtannāma kalau matsyodaraṃ priye || 16/48 ||
	ye cāsmānnirgatā devi varṇayiṣyāmi te'khilam |
	etasmād yoginīkaulānnāmnā jñānasya nirṇītau || 16/49 ||
	kṣaṇena yoginī hṛṣṭā devyā saha vināyakaḥ |
	catvāraḥ kulasiddhastu pṛcchamānā subhāvitā || 16/50 ||
	romāñcakañcukā sarve puṣpahastāstu bodhitā |
	daṇḍavat patitāḥ sarve ātmavādaṃ vada prabho ||
	yogābhyāsaratānāntu raktapālasya nirṇayam || 16/51 ||


bhairava uvā(ca)


	ahaṃ tvaṃ ca viśālākṣi candradvīpasamāgatau |
	ṣaṭmukho vaṭuko jātāḥ kṣetrapālakulāgame || 16/52 ||
	sidhyante koṭayaḥ sapta tāvattvaṃ kṣetrapālakaḥ |
	vaṭukau kiṃ na vijñātau sutau tulyaṃ varānane || 16/53 ||
	siddhāmṛte tu yat proktaṃ gurornindā vigarhitā |
	tathyācyavanasaṃjātaṃ patitaṃ ca mahodadhau || 16/54 ||
	kalau yuge mahāghore divyaiḥ saṃsādhito'pi saḥ |
	tantre tantre samākhyātaṃ yathāśāpantu prāptavān || 16/55 ||
	tasya pūjābaliḥ piṇḍa āsanaṃ jāpyameva ca |
	kathayāmi samāsena yathā sidhyati sādhake || 16/56 ||

	hrīṃ vaṭukāya kapilajaṭāya piṅgalanetrāya devīputrāya mātṛputrāya 
imāṃ baliṃ mamopanītāṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa curu murū hrīṃ balimantra cāla cāla 
bhakṣa 200 piṇḍamantraḥ yatkiñcit bhakṣayet prājñaḥ agrapiṇḍantu dāpayet | 
hrīṃ vaṭukāya āsanamantraḥ hyauṃ hyauhyaṃ mahābhairava pūjanamantraḥ | 
hrīṃ hrāṃ jāpya (-)

	yaḥ sadā jāpyamidaṃ kuryānnirvighnaṃ siddhibhājanaḥ |
	gṛhṇa gṛhṇeti vaktavyaṃ gṛhṇāti vaṭukastathā || 16/57 ||
	daṇḍahastaṃ sadādhyāyejjaṭilaṃ brahmatejasam |
	raktāmbaraparīdhānaṃ vaṭukaṃ vighnamardakam || 16/58 ||
	pūjyamānaṃ sadākālaṃ agrato daṇḍapāṇinam |
	caturaṅgabalaṃ jitvā uṣṭānāṃ (?) stambhakārakam || 16/59 ||
	caurarājakulādīnāṃ sarpavyāghragajādiṣu |
	hrīṃ ca vaṭuka hrīṃ
	imāṃ vidyāṃ jāpyaṃ kuryādbhayorddhitā || 16/60 ||
	nāśayet sarvaduṣṭānāṃ siṃhasyaiva yathā gajāḥ |
	yatra tatra kṣudrasiddhirbahudhā śāstracoditā || 16/61 ||
	hrīṃ vaṭuka uktamantreṇa karoti surasundari |
	hrīṃ kārāṅkararādyevaṃ vaṭukaṃ siddhipūjitam |
	pūjayettat pra(ya)tnena kaulave siddhimicchatā || 16/62 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye mahāyoginīkaule matsyendrapādāvatāre candradvīpavinirgate 
ṣoḍaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 16/16 ||



[saptadaśaḥ paṭalaḥ]


devyuvāca


	yanmayā pṛcchitaṃ deva ātmavādasya nirṇayam |
	sāmprataṃ śrotumicchāmi niḥsandigdhaṃ vada prabho || 17/1 ||


bhairava uvāca 


	sādhu devi mahāyoge yoginīsiddhanāyike |
	gūḍhaṃ guhyaṃ sanābhiñca hṛdi padmamadhomukham || 17/2 ||
	samīrastobhakaṃ cakraṃ ghaṇṭikāgranthiśītalam |
	nāsāgraṃ dvādaśāntaṃ ca bhruvormadhye vyavasthitam || 17/3 ||
	lalāṭaṃ brahmarandhraṃ ca śikharasthaṃ sutejasam |
	ekādaśavidhaṃ proktaṃ vijñānaṃ dehamadhyataḥ || 17/4 ||
	kliśyanti manujātyantamajñātvā tu kulāgamam |
	hṛdisthasahajo deva smaraṇārhaḥ sa ucyate || 17/5 ||
	hakāro niṣkalo nityaḥ saṃkāraṃ sakalaṃ tathā |
	sṛkāraṃ tu sadā sṛṣṭi hītyevaṃ saṃharejjagat || 17/6 ||
	sakāraṃ śuklapakṣantu hakāraṃ kṛṣṇapakṣakam |
	hakāramīkṣamityāhurmahārthañca gataṃ param || 17/7 ||
	na śivena vinā śaktirna śaktirahitaḥ śivaḥ |
	anyo'nyañca pravartante agnidhūmau yathā priye || 17/8 ||
	na vṛkṣarahitā cchāyā na chāyārahito drumaḥ |
	śaktyābhyāsarato yogī kule sāmānyatāṃ vrajet || 17/9 ||
	sthūlaṃ sūkṣmaṃ paro haṃsau jñātvā sarvātmakaṃ priye |
	pāramparyān mataṃ kaulaṃ karṇāt karṇagataṃ param || 17/10 ||
	aparīkṣye na dātavyaṃ dātavyaṃ suparīkṣite |
	kṛtvā kulābhiṣekantu prakāśyaṃ tvātmanirṇayam || 17/11 ||
	pañcaratnādi deveśi jñātavyā tu kulāgame |
	prathamaṃ palitastambhaṃ dvitīyam īpsitaṃ bhavet || 17/12 ||
	tṛtīyaṃ kāmarūpatvaṃ caturthamakṣayāṃśakam |
	pañcamantu mahāratnaṃ jarāmaraṇanāśanam || 17/13 ||
	kṛtvā pretāsanaṃ divyaṃ dvādaśāntamanāsṛtam |
	bhūgṛhe nirjane deśe gandhadhūpasudhūpite || 17/14 ||
	śuklāmbaradharo bhūtvā śrīkhaṇḍena vilekhayet |
	paryaṅkaṃ vinyasettatra susahāyasamanvitam || 17/15 ||
	mahāvyāptimahānidrāṃ na śṛṇoti na paśyati |
	sugandhaṃ pūtigandhaṃ vā karpūrañcandanādiṣu || 17/16 ||
	na gandhaṃ vetti tattvajño mahāvyāptiriyaṃ priye |
	atītānāgatañcaiva tasmin kālasya vañcanam || 17/17 ||
	kartā hartā bhaveddevi yadukto vīramātare |
	adhorddhve ramate haṃso dvādaśānte layaṃ punaḥ || 17/18 ||
	hṛdisthaṃ niścalībhūtaṃ kumbhamadhye jalaṃ yathā |
	mṛṇālatantusadṛśaṃ bhāvābhāvavivarjitam || 17/19 ||
	dhāraṇādheyarahitaṃ sarvajñaṃ sarvatoditam |
	svayaṃ ca calate corddhvam adhañcaiva svayampunaḥ || 17/20 ||
	ramate sahajaṃ tattvaṃ yathātmani tathāpare |
	jñātvā tattvamidandevi bhavabandhātmakaiḥ priye || 17/21 ||
	karṇañca hṛdaye kṛtvā jñātavyaṃ haṃsalakṣaṇam |
	kaṇṭhasthāne dhvanirdivyā sakalā tu parāparā || 17/22 ||
	āpādatalamūrddhāntā vāmākhyaṃ kuṇḍalākṛtim |
	gudasthamudayantasyā dvādaśānte layaṃ punaḥ || 17/23 ||
	evaṃ tu carate haṃso dehamadhye śubhāśubhe |
	nirlepaṃ niṣkalṃ corddhe śuddhamatyantanirmalam || 17/24 ||
	nigarbhaṃ garbharūpeṇa nityānandaikalakṣaṇam |
	jñātavyaṃ gahanaṃ nātha mahājñānagataṃ param || 17/25 ||
	aprameyamacintyaṃ ca nirābhyāsapadaṃ smṛtam |
	niśvāsocchvāsasaṃyuktaṃ bhāvābhāvasamanvitam || 17/26 ||
	sa sañcarati bhūteṣu bhūtagrāme caturvidhe |
	sa ātmā sa svayaṃ kartā piṇḍaṃ caiva tu saṃharet || 17/27 ||
	piṇḍasyaivambhavedduḥkhaṃ bandhasyaiva sukhaṃ param |
	viṣādaṃ hariṣañcaiva jarāmaraṇameva ca || 17/28 ||
	kṣudhā tṛṣā ca mohaśca bhayādyā lobhameva ca |
	dāridrambandhanādīni piṇḍasyaiva sulocane || 17/29 ||
	na cāsau chidyate śastrairṇa cakreṇa balīyasā |
	bhidyanti naiva vajreṇa na ca vahnau dahatyasau || 17/30 ||
	na jalena bhavenmṛtyurna jale jīvitaṃ bhavet |
	na mohaṃ na ca vā rāgaṃ na madaṃ matsaraṃ sadā || 17/31 ||
	na lobhaṃ na ca vā kopaṃ na cintā bādhyate te (?) saḥ |
	indriyāṇāmidaṃ sarvaṃ bhūtānāṃ ca varaprade || 17/32 ||
	jīvena ca jagat sṛṣṭaṃ sa jīvastattvanāyakaḥ |
	sa jīvaḥ pudgalo haṃsaḥ sa śivo vyāpakaḥ paraḥ || 17/33 ||
	sa manastūcyate bhadre vyāpakaḥ sa carācare |
	ātmānamātmanā jñātvā bhuktimuktipradāyakā || 17/34 ||
	prathamā tu gururhyātmā ātmānaṃ bandhayet punaḥ |
	bandhastu mocayed hyātmā ātmānamātmanaḥ prabhuḥ || 17/35 ||
	ātmānamātmanā jñātvā ātmā vai kāyarūpiṇaḥ |
	ātmanaścāparo devi yena jñātaṃ sa yogirāṭ || 17/36 ||
	sa śivaḥ procyate sākṣāt sa mukto mocayet paraḥ |
	suviśuddhaḥ sadā devi paṅkasthamiva paṅkajam || 17/37 ||
	mānuṣyaṃ piṇḍamāsṛtya sa śivaḥ krīḍate bhuvi |
	itthambhūtaṃ parātmānaṃ yena jñātaṃ subhāmini || 17/78 ||
	tasyaiva sparśamātreṇa bhavenmuktirna saṃśayaḥ |
	tasyocchiṣṭañca saṃprāpya bhavenmuktiḥ parā priye || 17/79 ||
	tenaiva snāpite devi abhyaṅgodvartanena tu |
	tena pādena saṃspṛṣṭe so'pi mokṣasya bhājanaḥ || 17/40 ||
	ekena tena bhuktena bhuktaṃ caiva carācaram |
	sarvatīrtheṣu yat puṇyaṃ snātvā labhati mānavaḥ |
	taṃ jñeyantu manaḥ kṛtvā adhikaṃ tu phalaṃ labhet || 17/41 ||
	yoginīsiddhasadbhāvaṃ vīramātṛgaṇādiṣu |
	asyorddhve tu nigadyatu bhuktimuktipradaṃ śubham || 17/42 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye mahāyoginīkauleśrīmachendrapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate saptadaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 17/17 ||



[aṣṭādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca


	siddhānāṃ pūjanandeva dehasthapratyayātmakam |
	kuladvīpavidhānaṃ ca saṃkṣepāt kathyatāṃ prabho ||
	kaulavaṃ siddhikāmasya abhiṣekaṃ kīdṛg bhavet || 18/1 ||


bhairava uvāca


	sādhūktaṃ kathayiṣyāmi kulaṃ dvīpasya yo vidhiḥ |
	yavādyāśālicūrṇantu piṣṭaṃ vā godhūmodbhavam || 18/2 ||
	yena kenacit piṣṭena anena surasundari |
	hrīṃkāramantritaṃ kṛtvā vartidvādaśabhūṣitam || 18/3 ||
	kṣīrakhaṇḍādimṛṣṭantu ghṛtapūrṇasuśobhanam |
	pārśve tu pūjayet siddhāṃ yoginīṃ gurumeva ca || 18/4 ||
	ekakālaṃ dvikālaṃ vā triṣkālaṃ pūjayet kramam |
	agrataḥ pūjayennityaṃ bhuñjamānāgranāyike || 18/5 ||
	japedbījaparaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ hrīṃkāraṃ yoginīpriyam |
	yoginīmelakaṃ hyasmin bhuktimuktipradaḥ sadā || 18/6 ||
	athānyaṃ sampravakṣyāmi abhiṣeke kulagocare |
	raktena pūrayed raktaṃ śukrasyaiva samaṃ priye || 18/7 ||
	kuṇḍagolodbhavenaiva madhuṃ ca ghṛtasaṃyutam |
	raktaṃ vāmāmṛtaṃ śukraṃ surayā brahmamiśritam || 18/8 ||
	vukapuṣpasamāyuktakṛṣṇāsavasamāyutam |
	madirānandacaitanyaṃ bhaktiyukto mahātmanaḥ || 18/9 ||
	uddharedrumamantrantu gurusiddhāñca devatām |

	hrīṃ klīṃ mhau juṃ saḥ (-)

	śaṅkhasthaṃ kalaśasthaṃ vā pūjayitvā yathākramam || 18/10 ||
	dṛḍhabhaktasya deveśe ācāryo dṛḍhalakṣavit |
	jayādyāścauṣadhīḥ (?) sarvā mohanādyā kṛtāñjalī || 18/11 ||
	pañcaratnasamopetāṃ raktayuktena veṣṭitam |
	kṣārakṣīradadhisarpi madyode ikṣumeva ca || 18/12 ||
	svādudañcaiva garbhādaṃ krameṇa parijalpayet |
	vaktrekaikaśo (?) madhye ca aṣṭau tāṃ kulaparvatām || 18/13 ||
	veśyākumārikābhirvā ācāryaḥ svakaraistathā |
	uddhṛtya śirasi dadyāt tato yogī bhaviṣyati || 18/14 ||
	punastu yajanaṃ vakṣye yathāvattannibodha me |
	raktaṃ yuktaṃ samādāya athavā citrajaṃ śubham || 18/15 ||
	tatastuṣṭajayeddevi kramañcaiva samāhita |
	akṣataiḥ śālijairdirvyairanyairvāpi suśobhanaiḥ || 18/16 ||
	catuḥṣaṣṭikramayutaiḥ pūjayet tatkramaṃ śubham |
	divyasugandhapuṣpaistu vicitrābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 18/17 ||
	ācāryaḥ sumano bhūtvā sarvasaṃbhārasaṃbhṛtaḥ |
	yoginī siddhavīrāṇāṃ bhavate mātṛvallabhaḥ || 18/18 ||
	madyamāṃsasamāyuktaṃ bhakṣyabhojyayutaṃ priye |
	ghṛtakhaṇḍasamāyuktaṃ śarkarāyāntu pūrayet || 18/19 ||
	kumbhādi ca varaṃ dadyāt sahasraṃ vā śatairapi |
	catuḥṣaṣṭiñca saudarya aṣṭau ca guṇāpi vā || 18/20 ||
	nivedya gurave mānaṃ gurupūjā viśeṣataḥ |
	vīrapūjāṃ tataḥ kṛtvā yena tuṣyet punaḥ punaḥ || 18/21 ||
	carukaṃ bhakṣayet prājñaḥ samayahīne na dāpayet |
	vaktrādvaktraṃ viśeṣeṇa siddhibhāgyaḥ samānyathā || 18/22 ||
	sāmānye kathitaṃ kumbhe śaṅkhādvaktraṃ viśeṣataḥ |
	śāstroktaṃ tu kramaṃ pūjya sarvasaṃbhārasambhṛtaḥ |
	anenārabdhamātreṇa siddhiyogyo bhavettataḥ || 18/23 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye mahākaule candradvīpavinirgate aṣṭādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 18/18 ||



[ūnaviṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca


	dehasthaṃ paṅkajaṃ deva siddhānāṃ sāmprataṃ vada |


bhairava uvāca


	devyāścakraṅgatāḥ sarve divyarūpasutejasaḥ || 19/1 ||
	ṣoḍaśākṛtayaḥ sarve tanmadhye ātmanampriye |
	mokṣakāmī sadā dhyāyecchuklāmbaradharāṃ śubhām || 19/2 ||
	sadā yauvanakāminyaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇantu cintayet |
	raktāmbaradharā dhyāyedraktagandhānulepanaḥ || 19/3 ||
	raktābhī raktamālābhirbhūṣitā siddhayoginī |
	tanmadhye cātma(nā) devi tadrūpaṃ paribhāvayet || 19/4 ||
	śrīnāthaṃ yoginīsārddhaṃ vṛndarūpañca bhāsini |
	śaṅkhahastā sadā dhyāyenmanasā cintitaṃ labhet || 19/5 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye mahāyoginīkaule śrīmīnapādāvatārite ekonnaviṃśatitamaḥ 
paṭalaḥ] || 19/19 ||




[viṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ]
bhairava uvāca


	śṛṇu tvamadbhutandevi loke'smin mokṣapratyayam |
	gūdorddhvampīḍayennātha hṛdi kaṇṭhādikaṃ priye || 20/1 ||
	utpātaṃ nikṣipedūrddhvaṃ prāṇāyāmena sundari |
	kapālaṃ bhedamayāti yānti jīvo nirañjanam || 20/2 ||
	sa śivo vyāpako bhūtvā kartā hartā varānane |
	ātmānaṃ ca paraṃ vetti vettityevaṃ carācaram || 20/3 ||
	duḥkhantasya na vidyeta sukhantasya nirantaram |
	athānyaṃ sāmprataṃ devi pratyakṣamabhyaset sadā || 20/4 ||
	śaktyācārarato nityaṃ jitāhāraikamaithunaḥ |
	anāmāpīḍayedūrddhvaṃ nābhiñca hṛdayantathā || 20/5 ||
	śyāmasūtragataṃ lakṣaṃ śaktyāgrasaṃsthitaṃ manaḥ |
	ātmaprāṇasamaṃ kṛtvā śaktyācārāgrasaṃsthitam || 20/6 ||
	puṣpe vā pratimādyeṣu abhyāsāccalate priye |
	ṣaṭmāsādabhyaseddevi niśvāsoccaparāṅmukhāḥ || 20/7 ||
	abdamanekaṃ deveśe deśadeśāntaraṃ vrajet |
	paradehapraveśaṃ syādabhyāsaṃ varṇitaṃ tava || 20/8 ||
	athānyaṃ sāmprataṃ bhadre śṛṇu tvaṃ vīranāyike |
	kulāśaktestu vīrasya tathānyaṃ śaktilakṣaṇam || 20/9 ||
	anādinidhanā śaktiricchā nāma śivodbhavā |
	vyomamālinī sā bhadre khecarīti nigadyate || 20/10 ||
	vāmākhyā kuṇḍalīnāma jyeṣṭhā caiva manonmanī |
	rudraśaktistu vikhyātā kāmākhyā tu gīyate || 20/11 ||
	agraṇī caiva sarveṣāṃ likhyate na ca paṭhyate |
	mātṛkā śabdarā(śiśca) sarvagrantheṣu kīrtyate || 20/12 ||

devyuvāca 

	jñānaśaktirmayā jñātā kriyāśaktīrvada prabho |

bhairava uvāca

	kathayāmi samāsena vīrasya śaktilakṣaṇam || 20/13 ||
	uttamā dhavalākṣī tu kuṭilāgrāgrakeśinī |
	daśanaiśca jyotsnākāraiḥ surūpā cārubhāṣiṇī || 20/14 ||
	kule bhaktisamāyuktā gurudevyā prapūjakā |
	surūpā sukhabhāvā ca subhruvā sulalāṭakā || 20/15 ||
	kulāgamena bhakti (........) bhayavarjitā |
	suśīlā subhagā devi janānandakarā śubhā || 20/16 ||
	durlabhā lokamadhye tu jñānavartasya rakṣyate |
	itthaṃbhūtā yadā śaktirvīrasya lakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu || 20/17 ||
	surūpaḥ susvabhāvaśca satyavādī ca niścayī |
	gurukaulāgame bhaktaḥ susandhaḥ krodhavarjitaḥ || 20/18 ||
	suśūraḥ subhago nityaṃ svadehapratyayānvitaḥ |
	īdṛśī bhavate vīrā rudraśaktyā hyadhiṣṭhitā || 20/19 ||
	yattejaḥ sa mahāliṅgamutpattisthitikārakaḥ |
	bindurūpaṃ tu taṃ jñātvā sphurajjvālāvalīparaḥ || 20/20 ||
	akṣobhyaḥ sarvaśaktīnāṃ ātmaśaktyāntarañjitaḥ |
	sujñātvā dehajaṃ śaktiṃ tadā śaktiparigrahe || 20/21 ||
	jñānavijñānasampannaḥ advaitācārabhāvitaḥ |
	kulakaulāgame bhakti īdṛśaṃ vīralakṣaṇam || 20/22 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye yoginīkaule śrīmīnapādāvatārite candradvīpavinirgate 
viṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 20/20 ||



[ekaviṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

	saṃgrahaṃ vada me nātha vartanaṃ kulagocare |

bhairava uvāca 

	kathayāmi na sandeho saṃgrahācāralakṣaṇam || 21/1 ||
	pañcapañcāśiko devi mataṃ vai yogalakṣaṇam |
	tasya bhedopabhedena kaulaśāstre vinirṇayam || 21/2 ||
	kulapañcāśikāmūlaṃ tathā ca kulasāgaram |
	kulogho hṛdayañcaiva bhairavodyānakaṃ tathā || 21/3 ||
	candrakaulañca veṣṭiñca(?) tathā vai jñānanirṇayam |
	asya madhye viniṣkrāntaṃ sambaranāma viśrutam || 21/4 ||
	sṛṣṭikaulaṃ mahākaulaṃ timiraṃ ca tathāparam |
	siddhāmṛtaṃ tu kaulaṃ mātakaulaṃ tathāparam || 21/5 ||
	śaktibhedaṃ tathā kaulaṃ ūrmikaulamanuttamam |
	caturyugeṣu deveśi jñānakaulasya saṃgatiḥ || 21/6 ||
	siddheśvaraṃ tathā cānyaṃ kaulaṃ vai vajrasambhavam |
	meghajāñca dūrataṃ tasmin kaule vinirgatam || 21/7 ||
	aṅgasparśaniścaraṃ devi vajradādyāmṛtaṃ tathā |
	pūrṇimāyāṃ amāvasyāṃ aṣṭamī ca caturdaśī || 21/8 ||
	sajīvaṃ matsyamadyañca māṃsañcaiva baliṃ da(det) |
	vyākhyā caiva tu kartavyā ācāryaḥ śaṅkavarjitaḥ || 21/9 ||
	na tithirna ca nakṣatraṃ nopavāsaṃ vidhīyate |
	yatra tatra sthito yogī jñānamevaṃ samāśrayet |
	kathitaṃ kaulasadbhāvaṃ nāmnā jñānasya nirṇaye || 21/10 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye mahāyoginīkaule śrīmīnapādāvatārite candradvīpavinirgate 
ekaviṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 21/21 ||



[dvāviṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca


	praṇamya prāñjali (......) va adyāhaṃ tava vallabha |
	adyāhaṃ kṛtakṛtyā tu hara siddhivināyakaḥ || 22/1 ||
	ṣaḍmukhaśca mahākāla(ḥ) kālikā yoginī tathā |
	nandīśo bhaṭṭakā caiva droṇakā ca tatha (....) || 22/2 ||
	vijayā tu mahābhāgā ṣaḍyoginyastu mātarāḥ |
	kaulāmṛte na saṃtṛpto ahaṃ sarve'pi bhairava || 22/3 ||


bhairava uvāca


	yat purā gopitaṃ bhadre tat sarvaṃ prakaṭīkṛtaḥ |
	bhūloke devatānāñca kathitavyaṃ kulāgame || 22/4 ||
	siddhānāñca viśeṣeṇa khyāpanīyaṃ kulānva(yam) |
	samayācārasamopetaṃ vijñānaṃ dvaitavāsinām || 22/5 ||
	guptaliṅgī sadā kālaṃ gurupūjanatatparaḥ |
	vatsalaḥ sarvalokānāṃ sarvajīvadayānvitaḥ || 22/6 ||
	bhairavavacanaṃ śrutvāsarvaromāñcakañcukāḥ |
	santuṣṭamanasaḥ sarve daṇḍavat pati(tāḥ) bhuvi ||
	kulabhāvaparāḥ sarve kṛtakṛtyā surādhipāḥ || 22/7 ||
	adya me gahanaṃ naṣṭaṃ ajñānapaṭalāhatam |
	saṃsārataruvistīrṇamadya chinnaṃ tvayā prabho || 22/8 ||
	pāśajālatamoghañca chinnādya duḥkhasaṃśayaḥ |
	daśakoṭistathā cārddhaṃ nāmnā jñānasya nirṇayaḥ || 22/9 ||
	tasya madhye imaṃ nātha sārabhūtaṃ samuddhṛtam |
	kāmarūpe imaṃ śāstraṃ yoginīnāṃ gṛhe gṛhe || 22/10 ||
	nigrahānugrahañcaiva siddhimelāpakaṃ tathā |
	kurvanti satataṃ devi asya jñānaprasādataḥ || 22/11 ||
	candradvīpaṃ mahāśāstraṃ avatīrṇaṃ sulocane |
	kāmākhye gīyate nāthe mahāmatsyodarasthitiḥ || 22/12 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye mahāyoginīkaule śrīmatsyendrapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate dvāviṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 22/22 ||



[trayoviṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

	kaulave yoginī deva sañcaranti kathaṃ bhuvi |
	tanmamācakṣva deveśa bhaktyā jānanti bhūtale || 23/1 ||

bhairava uvāca

	martye'smin devatānāntu sañcāraṃ śṛṇu bhāmini |
	kapotikā tathā gṛdhrī haṃsī caiva nakhī tathā || 23/2 ||
	khañjaḥ (......) bhāṣī tu kokābhāṣī tu sundari |
	ulukī pecakī vā tu sararī vā gūlī tathā || 23/3 ||
	śṛgālī ajā mahiṣī (uṣṭrī) mārjāranakulīi tathā |
	vyāghrī hastī mayūrī ca kukuṭī na (...............) || 23/4 ||
	anyāni yāni rūpāṇi saṃsthitāni mahītale |
	tāni rūpāṇi saṃgṛhya yoginyaḥ krīḍante bhuvi || 23/5 ||
	nipatanti yadā bhadre abhakṣyeṣu kulādhipe |
	tadrūpaṃ kathyante (.................) yuktāvadhārayet || 23/6 ||
	hayaśca nakharaḥ sarpa citrikotmānasastathā |
	vṛścikodhyantaraścāno mūṣako darduraḥ priye || 23/7 ||
	grahabhūtasvarūpeṇa jvālāgniśāstrasaṅkaṭaiḥ |
	veda (......................)vyādhirājānañcaiva taskarāḥ || 23/8 ||
	vidyuttuṅgo tathā gaṇḍa vyāghrasiṃhagajastathā |
	anekākārarūpeṇa bhayaṃ nānāvidhaṃ viduḥ || 23/9 ||
	catuḥṣaṣṭiśca yoginyo(...............)pyanti sādhake |
	evaṃ rūpaṃ samāsṛtya kṣipraṃ gṛhṇanti taṃ paśum || 23/10 ||
	kopantu naiva kartavyaṃ bhāṣamāṇaṃ surādhipe |
	kumārikā striyo vāpi bhāṣamāṇe kadācana || 23/11 ||
	yathā śaktyā sadā kālaṃ strī caiva vratamāsthitam |
	pūjanīyā prayatnena kumāryaśca kulāśritaiḥ || 23/12 ||
	punnāgaṃ nāgacaṃpādyairmucukundaiśca pāṭalaiḥ |
	pārijātodbhaveddivyairdāḍimaiḥ kusumojjvalaiḥ || 23/13 ||
	bandhukaḥ kusumodbhūtaiścampakaḥ kusumojjvalaiḥ |
	jātyutpalakadambaiśca karṇikāraiḥ siṃhakeśaraiḥ || 23/14 ||
	ambhorūhaistathā puṣpaiḥ śubhaiḥ śālāvibhūṣitaiḥ |
	raktāmbaradharāṃ dhyāyedraktagandhānulepitām || 23/15 ||
	ātmānaṃ yoginīsiddhe ratnamālā vibhūṣitām |
	dhyāyettāṃ satataṃ vīrāṃ bahiḥ pūjāṃ vivarjayet |
	pūjanaṃ kathitaṃ bhadre bhuktimuktiprasādhakam || 23/16 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye mahāyoginīkaule śrīmatsyendrapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate trayoviṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 23/23 ||



[caturviṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

	saphalama(dya) me nātha kāruṇyaṃ tava bhairava |
	asurāṇāṃ surāṇāñca prabhutvamadya me prabho || 24/1 ||
	mahākaulaṃ mahājñānaṃ kulakaulasya nirṇayam |
	bhrāntisaṃsāragahanamajñānapaṭala(nta)maḥ || 24/2 ||
	saṃsārapāśajālañca adya(?) nirṇāśitaṃ tvayā |
	adyamāpāditā muktiḥ svatantrā bhuvi durlabhā |
	punaḥ kathaya kauleśa dehasthaṃ siddhapūjanam || 24/3 ||

bhairava uvāca

	(........)ṣandigdhaṃ kathayiṣyāmi kaule'smin pūjanaṃ śṛṇu |
	kulasiddhāśca yoginyo rudrāścaiva kulādhipe || 24/4 ||
	devyāścakragatāḥ sarve hṛdi madhye śire'pi vā |
	bahisthaṃ pūjaye(..............)pūjāvidhi priye || 24/5 ||
	sugandhakundaketakyā mālikājātikotpalaiḥ |
	campakaiḥ kiṅkarātaiśca nīlotpalasugandhibhiḥ || 24/6 ||
	puṣpairnānāvidhaiścaiva śatapatraiśca (..............) |
	tarujātantaśva rādeyā (?) dravyā(pi) madhumiśritām || 24/7 ||
	māṃsampalambalirdeyā tāmbūlaṃ candrasaṃyutam |
	dhūpacandanasaurabhyaṃ aguruṃ mṛganābhikam || 24/8 ||
	raktapuṣpairviśeṣeṇa sugandha (dhūpadīpitam) |
	ugrāṇi yāni puṣpāṇi gandhahīnaṃ na dāpayet || 24/9 ||
	bahisthaṃ pūjanaṃ proktaṃ adhyātmaṃ śṛṇu sāmpratam |
	raktāmbaradharāḥ sarve raktagandhānulepanāḥ || 24/10 ||
	ṣoḍaśākṛtayaḥ sa (.......................) vibhūṣitāḥ |
	prasannavadanāścaiva pibantyo madirāsavam || 24/11 ||
	icchārūpadharāḥ sarve jarāmaraṇavarjitāḥ |
	sṛṣṭipravartakāḥ sarve varadānaikatatparāḥ ||
	i(...........)ḍādhyāyedacirāntatsamo bhavet || 24/12 ||


[iti jñānanirṇaye mahāyoginīkaulaśrīmatsyendrapādāvatārite 
candradvīpavinirgate caturviṃśatitamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 24/24 ||



	guhyapadadharaṃ proktaṃ daśakoṭistu nirṇayaḥ |
	siddhānāṃ yoginīnāṃ ca hṛdayaṃ para(ma)durlabham || 25/1 ||
	guhyād guhyataraṃ nāthe sārāt sārataraṃ param |
	samyagetanmayā bhadre aprakāśyaṃ prakāśitam || 25/2 ||
	mahākaula mahādevi śatairdaśabhiḥ sammitam |
	jñānasya nirṇaye sāraṃ nāmnā sāhasrikaṃ matam || 25/3 ||


[iti mahākaule jñānanirṇaye sāraṃ śrīmatsyendrapādāvatā(rite samāptaṃ ?)]


